	"The variable name '%S' already exists. Do you want to merge the two variables?": "變數名'%S'已存在。是否合併兩個變數？",
	"<hl>Behaviors</> offer means of customized automation of your units and buildings with a simple programming interface.\n\nThe game is designed to be enjoyed fully without using behaviors! But give them a go if you are inclined to eradicate a manual process or to maximize throughput in your base.\n\nA <hl>Behavior</> runs <hl>Instructions</> on one of your <hl>Units</> or <hl>Buildings</> in sequential order. <hl>Instructions</> can affect the behavior of <hl>Units</> and <hl>Buildings</>, branch the running sequence based on conditions or modify the value of a <hl>Parameter</> or <hl>Register</>. Check out the help topics for more details on the editor interface and general use of behaviors.": "<hl>行為</>通過簡易編程插槽，為裝置與建築提供訂製化自動化方案。\n\n本遊戲設計無需使用行為即可暢玩！但若您希望解放雙手或最大化基地產能，不妨嘗試運用行為系統。\n\n<hl>行為</>會按順序讓<hl>指令</>在您的<hl>裝置</>或<hl>建築</>上指令。<hl>指令</>可影響<hl>裝置</>和<hl>建築</>的行為，根據條件分支運行序列，或修改<hl>參數</>或<hl>暫存器</>的數值。有關編輯器界面及行為功能的詳細說明，請查閱相關幫助主題。",
