	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial": "點選“下一步”完成教學課程", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Waiting for this step...": "等待這一步…", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Use Next when you are ready.": "準備就緒後，請使用“下一步”。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Step complete. Press Next to Complete the Tutorial": "步驟完成。按下“下一步”完成教程。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Step complete. Press Next when you are ready.": "步驟完成。準備就緒後，請按“下一步”。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Step complete. Advancing...": "步驟完成。正在繼續…", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"The customizable icon of the behavior and a button for advanced behavior restart options.": "行為的自訂圖示及高級行為重啟選項按鈕。",
	"The customizable name and description of the behavior.\n\nBelow the description you'll find information about how many units and buildings have the behavior loaded and how many are actively running it at the moment.": "行為的自訂名稱與描述。\n\n描述下方將顯示當前載入該行為的裝置與建築數量，以及正在運行該行為的活躍數量。",
	"Buttons to save the behavior under a different name, clearing of the entire behavior, and access to this help screen.": "用於以不同名稱保存行為、清除整個行為以及訪問此幫助界面的按鈕。",
	"The <hl>base registers</> which can be used as input or output values of the behavior. They can also be set via the unit/building interface.": "可作為行為輸入或輸出值的<hl>基址暫存器</>。這些暫存器也可通過單元/建築界面進行設置。",
	"The list of <hl>parameters</> specific to the behavior. Any parameter can be an input or output value, or both. These correspond to the registers on the behavior controller visible in the unit/building interface.": "行為專用的<hl>參數</>列表。任何參數均可作為輸入值、輸出值或兼具雙重屬性。這些參數對應裝置/建築界面中可見的行為控制器所使用的暫存器。",
	"The list of available <hl>instructions</> which can be dragged into the working area.": "可用<hl>指令</>列表，可拖拽至工作區域",
	"The <hl>working area</> contains the instruction nodes which are connected to form the sequence of performed operations.\n\nYou can scroll the area by dragging empty space or by using WASD keys. To zoom it, use the mouse wheel or the buttons in the top right.\n\nIt is also possible to use right-click on empty space or on a connection point to quickly find and insert a new instruction.": "<hl>工作區域</>包含相互連接的指令節點，這些節點共同構成執行的操作序列。\n\n可透過拖動空白區域或使用WASD鍵進行滾動。縮放操作請使用滑鼠滾輪或右上角按鈕。\n\n此外，在空白區域或連接點上單擊右鍵，可快速定位並插入新指令。",
	"The camera view showing the unit that is currently being inspected.": "攝影機視角會顯示當前正在檢查的裝置。",
	"The information box for the currently selected instruction. It can be expanded to show more details and example code that can be added to the behavior.": "當前選定指令的資訊框。可展開以顯示更多詳細資訊和範例代碼，可以把這些程式碼添加到行為中。",
	"The first button here will switch the screen between displaying the active values in the currently inspected behavior controller and the code identifiers for parameters and variables.\nThe second button lets you select which behavior controller of your units to inspect.": "第一個按鈕可在當前檢查的行為控制器中切換顯示活動的值、參數或是變數的代碼標識符。\n第二個按鈕可讓您選擇要檢查的裝置行為控制器。",
	"Buttons to stop, start, pause, continue or step the behavior. Only available when a specific behavior controller is being inspected.": "該按鈕可用於停止、啟動、暫停、繼續或逐步執行行為。僅在檢查特定行為控制器時可用。",
	"These buttons undo or redo changes step by step.": "這些按鈕可逐步撤銷或重做更改。",
	"Buttons to close the editor and to apply or discard changes. Running the behavior will automatically apply any unsaved changes as well.": "該按鈕可關閉編輯器，並且應用或放棄更改。運行行為時未保存的更改也會自動應用。",
	"Welcome to Behaviors!": "歡迎使用行為編輯器！",
