	"Store": "儲存",
	"<header>Store</>\n<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> or <hl>Drag</>\n\nSet to an owned <hl>unit</> or <hl>building</> to transfer inventory when possible.\n\nUse <Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/> to set the minimum transfer amount.": "<header>儲存</>\n<hl>按住Ctrl鍵</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>或<hl>拖曳</>\n\n盡可能將其設置為已擁有的<hl>單元</>或<hl>建築物</>以轉移庫存。\n\n使用<Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/>設定最小轉移數量。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"<header>Visual</>\n\nShown in the game world, useful to link to production\nby dragging from the <hl>Production</> to the <hl>Visual</>\n\nChange visibility with <Key action=\"MapOverlay\" style=\"hl\"/>": "<header>視覺</>\n\n在遊戲畫面中顯示，可通過從<hl>生產</>拖動到<hl>視覺</>，將其連結到生產\n\n\n使用<Key action=\"MapOverlay\" style=\"hl\"/>更改顯示",
