	// FILE: Main/ui/behavior_guides.lua
	"Pickup Bot Behavior": "取貨機器人行為", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a simple pickup bot: scan for a dropped item, pick it up, repeat until full, then drop everything at a storage target. Use Next and Previous at any time; steps that can be detected advance automatically.": "本指南將建造一個簡單的拾取機器人：掃描掉落物品，拾取物品，重複此操作直至物品數量達到上限，然後將所有物品放置到目標存儲位置。您可以隨時使用「下一步」和「上一步」按鈕；可偵測到的步驟會自動推進。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add one behavior parameter and rename it <hl>Storage</> by clicking on its name. The bot needs a visible destination so the finished behavior can be reused with any storage building.": "新增行為參數，點選其名稱將其重新命名為<hl>Storage</>。機器人需要一個可見的目標位置，以便完成的行為可以復用於任何儲存建築。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"In the instruction list, open the <hl>Components</> category and drag <hl>Radar</> after the <hl>Program Start</> node. Use it to search for the closest dropped item. Radar returns a target reference, not an item type.": "在指令清單中，開啟<hl>元件</>類別，並將<hl>雷達</>拖曳到<hl>程式啟動</>節點之後。使用它來搜尋最近的已放置項目。 雷達回傳的是目標引用，而不是項類型。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"When a node is selected, this help area shows extra information about how to use it. For Radar, the Result output is the thing in the world that matches the filter, which later instructions can move to or pick up from.": "選取節點後，此說明區域會顯示有關如何使用該節點的額外資訊。對於雷達而言，「結果」輸出是與篩選條件相符的對象，後續指令可以將其移動到此處或從此處繼續執行。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"text": "文字", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set the first Radar filter to <img id=\"v_droppeditem\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>. Click the Radar node's <hl>Filter 1</> register and choose Dropped Item from the <hl>Information</> tab so Radar only finds item stacks on the ground.": "將第一個雷達過濾器設定為 <img id=\"v_droppeditem\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。點擊雷達節點的 <hl>過濾器 1</> 註冊，然後從 <hl>資訊</> 標籤中選擇掉落物品，以便雷達只查找地面上的物品堆。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Check Space": "空格", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Check Space for Item</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the Radar node, which is the normal path when Radar found something. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>檢查物品空間</>。將其拖曳到雷達節點的第一個/預設輸出引腳上，這是雷達發現物品時的正常路徑。不要將其連接到<hl>無結果</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Now pass the found target into Check Space for Item. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on the Radar node to the <hl>Item</> register on the Check Space for Item node. The editor will automatically create a local variable to pass the Radar result along.": "現在將找到的目標傳遞給「檢查專案空間」節點。將雷達節點上的 <hl>結果</> 暫存器拖曳到「檢查項目空間」節點上的 <hl>項目</> 暫存器。編輯器會自動建立一個局部變數來傳遞雷達結果。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Pick Up": "撿起", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Pick Up Items</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the Check Space for Item node, which is the normal path when the item fits. Do not attach it to <hl>Can't Fit</>.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>拾取物品</>。將其拖曳到「檢查物品空間」節點的第一個/預設輸出引腳上，這是物品可以放入時的正常路徑。不要將其連接到<hl>無法放入</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Now pass the same found target into Pick Up Items. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on the Radar node to the <hl>Source</> register on the Pick Up Items node. The editor will reuse the local variable carrying the Radar result. Leave Item / Amount empty so it picks up anything from the dropped item entity.": "現在將找到的目標傳遞給「拾取物品」節點。將雷達節點上的<hl>結果</>暫存器拖曳到拾​​取物品節點上的<hl>來源</>暫存器。編輯器將重複使用儲存雷達結果的局部變數。將「物品」/「數量」留空，以便拾取掉落物品實體中的任何物品。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Drop Off": "下車", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Drop Off Items</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>Can't Fit</> pin of the Check Space for Item node. This sends the bot to unload when it cannot fit the item Radar found.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>卸貨</>。將其拖曳到「檢查物品空間」節點的<hl>無法放置</>引腳上。這樣，當雷達偵測到的物品無法放置時，機器人就會卸載物品。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Connect the <hl>Storage</> parameter to the <hl>Destination</> register on Drop Off Items. Leave Item / Amount empty so Drop Off Items unloads everything the bot is carrying.": "將<hl>儲存</>參數連接到「卸貨」功能的<hl>目的地</>暫存器。將「物品/數量」留空，以便「卸貨」功能卸載機器人攜帶的所有物品。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Wait Ticks</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of the Radar node. You can set its <hl>Time</> register to how many ticks to wait; <hl>5</> means 5 ticks, which is 1 second.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>等待時脈週期</>。將其拖曳到雷達節點的<hl>無結果</>引腳上。您可以將其<hl>時間</>暫存器設定為等待的時脈週期數；<hl>5</>表示5個時脈週期，即1秒。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press <hl>Apply</> to save the behavior.": "按<hl>套用</>儲存此行為。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"icon": "圖示", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Exit the behavior editor with the button in the bottom right and select the unit running this behavior. You will see the parameter registers above the behavior; set the <hl>Storage</> register there by choosing the storage unit or building to unload into. You can also start or stop the behavior from this same panel. If it stalls, return to the editor and inspect the node register values.": "使用右下角的按鈕退出行為編輯器，然後選擇執行此行為的單元。您將在行為上方看到參數暫存器；透過選擇要卸載到的儲存單元或建築物，設定 <hl>Storage</> 暫存器。您也可以從同一面板啟動或停止行為。如果行為停止，請返回編輯器並檢查節點暫存器值。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Safe Miner Behavior": "安全礦工行為", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a miner that checks for enemies first. If an enemy is detected it goes to your home location; if no enemy is detected it scans for a mineable resource and mines it.": "本指南將介紹如何建造一台採礦機，它會先檢查是否有敵人出現。如果偵測到敵人，它會返回你的基地；如果沒有偵測到敵人，它會掃描可開採的資源並進行開採。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"In the instruction list, open the <hl>Components</> category and drag <hl>Radar</> after the <hl>Program Start</> node. This first Radar is the safety check.": "在指令清單中，開啟<hl>元件</>類別，並將<hl>雷達</>拖曳到<hl>程式啟動</>節點之後。第一個“雷達”是安全檢查。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set this Radar node's <hl>Filter 1</> register to <img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Enemy</>. Click Filter 1, open the <hl>Information</> tab, and choose Enemy.": "將此雷達節點的<hl>過濾器 1</>註冊設定為<img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>敵人</>。點選過濾器 1，開啟<hl>訊息</>選項卡，然後選擇敵人。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the enemy Radar node, which is the path used when Radar found an enemy. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>回家</>。將其拖曳到敵方雷達節點的第一個/預設輸出引腳上，該引腳是雷達發現敵人時所使用的路徑。不要將其連接到<hl>無結果</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. This makes the unit move after the home unit has been found.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>移動單元</>指令。將其拖曳到“回家”指令的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。這樣，在找到回家單元後，該單元就會移動。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the retreat target. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on Get Home to the <hl>Target</> register on Move Unit. The editor will create a local variable carrying your home location.": "設定撤退目標。將 Get Home 函數的 <hl>Result</> 暫存器拖曳到 Move Unit 函數的 <hl>Target</> 暫存器。編輯器將建立一個局部變數來儲存你的原點位置。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add a second <hl>Radar</> node. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of the enemy Radar node. This second Radar only runs when no enemy was detected.": "增加第二個<hl>雷達</>節點。將其拖曳到敵方雷達節點的<hl>無結果</>引腳上。第二個雷達僅在未偵測到敵人時運作。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Select the second Radar node and set its <hl>Filter 1</> register to <img id=\"v_mineable\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Mineable</>. Use the Information tab so it finds mineable resource deposits.": "選擇第二個雷達節點，並將其<hl>濾波器 1</>暫存器設定為<img id=\"v_mineable\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>可開採</>。使用「資訊」標籤尋找可開採的資源礦藏。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Mine</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the resource Radar node, which is the path used when Radar found a resource. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>Mine</>。將其拖曳到資源雷達節點的第一個/預設輸出引腳上，該引腳是雷達發現資源時所使用的路徑。請勿將其連接到<hl>No Result</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the mining target. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on the resource Radar node to the <hl>Resource</> register on the Mine node. The editor will create a local variable carrying the resource deposit.": "連接採礦目標。將資源雷達節點上的<hl>結果</>暫存器拖曳到採礦節點上的<hl>資源</>暫存器。編輯器將建立一個局部變數來儲存資源儲量。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Wait Ticks</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of the resource Radar node. Set <hl>Time</> to 5 if you want it to wait 1 second before scanning again.": "從指令清單中加入<hl>等待滴答</>。將其拖曳到資源雷達節點的<hl>無結果</>引腳上。如果希望在再次掃描前等待1秒，請將<hl>時間</>設定為5。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press <hl>Apply</> to save the behavior. Use it on a unit with a mining component.": "按<hl>套用</>儲存此行為。將其應用於帶有採礦組件的單位。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Exit the behavior editor in the bottom right, select the miner, and start or stop the behavior from the unit's behavior panel.": "從右下角退出行為編輯器，選擇礦工，然後從單位的行為面板啟動或停止該行為。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Run Away Behavior": "逃跑行為", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a reactive run-away behavior. A Radar writes an enemy target into a behavior parameter, and a Parameter Event immediately runs a branch that gets your home location and moves the unit there.": "本指南建構了一個響應式逃跑行為。雷達會將敵方目標寫入行為參數，參數事件會立即執行一個分支，取得你的基地位置並將單位移動到那裡。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add one behavior parameter and rename it <hl>Enemy</>. This parameter stores the current enemy target and is also the value watched by the event branch.": "新增一個行為參數並將其重新命名為<hl>Enemy</>。此參數儲存目前敵人目標，也是事件分支監視的值。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Radar</> from the <hl>Components</> category after <hl>Program Start</>. This polling branch is useful when the behavior controller does not already have a radar component feeding the Enemy parameter.": "在 <hl>程式開始</> 之後，從 <hl>元件</> 類別中加入 <hl>雷達</>。當行為控制器中還沒有雷達元件為「敵人」參數提供資料時，此輪詢分支非常有用。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Radar <hl>Filter 1</> to <img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Enemy</>. Click Filter 1, open the <hl>Information</> tab, and choose Enemy.": "將雷達<hl>過濾器 1</>設定為<img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>敵人</>。點選過濾器 1，開啟<hl>訊息</>選項卡，然後選擇敵人。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Drag from the Radar <hl>Result</> register to the <hl>Enemy</> parameter register above the graph. This stores the detected enemy in the behavior parameter.": "將雷達<hl>結果</>暫存器拖曳到圖表上方的<hl>敵人</>參數暫存器。這樣就能將偵測到的敵人儲存在行為參數中。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"If the behavior controller has a radar component, this Radar node is optional. Instead, link the radar component's enemy/result register directly to the behavior's <hl>Enemy</> parameter register on the unit panel. The Parameter Event branch will still react when Enemy changes.": "如果行為控制器包含雷達元件，則此雷達節點是可選的。您可以改為將雷達組件的敵人/結果暫存器直接連結到單位面板上行為的<hl>敵人</>參數暫存器。當敵人發生變化時，參數事件分支仍會做出反應。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Parameter Event</> from the instruction list. Place it as a separate branch, not connected to Program Start.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>參數事件</>。將其放在一個單獨的分支中，不要連接到程式啟動分支。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set which parameter the event listens to. In the <hl>Parameter Event</> node body, click <hl>Select</> and choose the <hl>Enemy</> parameter. This makes the event branch run whenever the value of <hl>Enemy</> changes.": "設定事件監聽的參數。在<hl>參數事件</>節點主體中，點選<hl>選擇</>並選擇<hl>敵人</>參數。這樣，當<hl>敵人</>的值發生變化時，事件分支就會運作。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the Parameter Event node. This branch starts whenever the value of <hl>Enemy</> changes.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>回家</>。將其拖曳到參數事件節點的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。每當<hl>敵人</>的值改變時，此分支就會啟動。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. Leave it set to <hl>Synchronous</> so the behavior waits while moving home.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>移動單元</>。將其拖曳到“回家”指令的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。將其設定為<hl>同步</>，以便在移動回原點時保持等待狀態。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the home target. Drag from the Get Home <hl>Result</> register to the Move Unit <hl>Target</> register. The editor will create a local variable carrying the home target.": "連接回零目標。將<hl>取得回零</>暫存器中的資料拖曳到<hl>移動單元</>暫存器中的資料。編輯器將建立一個局部變數來儲存回零目標。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the end of <hl>Move Unit</> unconnected. Reaching the end of this event branch finishes the reaction, then the behavior can keep waiting for the next Enemy parameter change.": "將<hl>移動單位</>的末端保持斷開狀態。到達此事件分支的末端將完成回應，然後行為可以繼續等待下一個敵人參數的變化。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the unit, and start the behavior. If using a radar component instead of the Radar node, link that component's enemy/result register to the behavior's <hl>Enemy</> parameter register above the behavior.": "按下“下一步”完成教程。退出行為編輯器，選擇單位，然後啟動行為。如果使用雷達組件而不是雷達節點，請將該組件的敵人/結果暫存器連結到行為上方的<hl>敵人</>參數暫存器。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Battery Return Home Behavior": "電池返回家園行為", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a battery saving behavior. It reads the unit's battery percentage, compares it to 30, and sends the unit home when the battery is 30% or lower. You can change 30 to whatever battery percent you want to check.": "本指南旨在建立省電模式。它會讀取設備的電池電量百分比，並將其與 30% 進行比較，當電量低於 30% 時，設備會自動返回充電座。您可以將 30% 更改為您想要檢查的任何電量百分比。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Battery</> from the <hl>Units</> category after <hl>Program Start</>. Leave its optional Unit register empty so it checks the unit running the behavior.": "在<hl>單元</>類別中，於<hl>程式啟動</>之後新增<hl>取得電池</>功能。將其可選的“單元”暫存器留空，以便它檢查運行該行為的單元。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Compare Number</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Battery.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>比較編號</>。將其拖曳到“獲取電池”功能的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the battery value. Drag from the Get Battery <hl>Percent</> register to the Compare Number <hl>Value</> register. The editor will create a local variable carrying the battery percent.": "將電池值連接到暫存器。從<hl>取得電池百分比</>暫存器拖曳到<hl>比較數值</>暫存器。編輯器將建立一個局部變數來儲存電池百分比。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Compare Number <hl>Compare</> to <hl>30</>. This means the return-home branch will run when battery percent is equal to 30 or smaller than 30. You can use any percent you want later.": "將比較數值<hl>比較</>設定為<hl>30</>。這意味著當電池電量百分比等於或小於30%時，返航分支將運行。您稍後可以設定任何您想要的百分比。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>If Equal</> pin of Compare Number. Then also connect Compare Number's <hl>If Smaller</> pin to the same Get Home node.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>Get Home</>。將其拖曳到「比較數字」節點的<hl>If Equal</>引腳上。然後將「比較數位」節點的<hl>If Smaller</>引腳也連接到同一個「Get Home」節點。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. Leave it set to <hl>Synchronous</> so the behavior waits while the unit returns home.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>移動單元</>。將其拖曳到「返航」指令的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。將其設定為<hl>同步</>，以便在單元返回原點時執行此操作。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the end of Move Unit unconnected, and leave Compare Number's <hl>If Larger</> pin empty for now. Reaching the end restarts the behavior, so it keeps checking the battery. Later you can attach any normal-work branch to <hl>If Larger</>.": "暫時不要連接「移動單元」的末端，也不要連接「比較數字」的<hl>如果更大</>引腳。到達末端會重新啟動程序，因此它會持續檢查電池電量。之後，您可以將任何正常工作分支連接到<hl>如果更大</>引腳。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the unit, and start or stop the behavior from the unit's behavior panel.": "按下“下一步”完成教程。退出行為編輯器，選擇單元，然後從單元的行為面板啟動或停止行為。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Scout With Enemy Avoidance Behavior": "偵察兵規避敵方行為", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a scout that checks for enemies before moving. If it sees an enemy it goes home; if it sees no enemy it scouts a random nearby area and stores its latest location for the next scout move.": "本指南將指導您如何建造一個偵察兵，它會在移動前檢查是否有敵人出現。如果發現敵人，它會返回基地；如果沒有發現敵人，它會偵察附近隨機區域，並將最新位置保存下來，以便下次偵察行動使用。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Radar</> from the <hl>Components</> category after <hl>Program Start</>. This Radar is the danger check.": "在<hl>程序啟動</>之後，從<hl>組件</>類別中新增<hl>雷達</>。此雷達用於危險檢查。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Radar <hl>Filter 1</> to <img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Enemy</>. Use the Information tab.": "將雷達<hl>過濾器 1</>設定為<img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>敵人</>。使用“資訊”選項卡。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Radar, which is the path used when an enemy was found. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>回家</>。將其拖曳到雷達的第一個/預設輸出引腳上，該引腳用於發現敵人時使用的路徑。不要將其附加到<hl>無結果</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. This is the retreat action.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>移動單元</>。將其拖曳到「返航」指令的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。這是撤退操作。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the retreat target. Drag from Get Home <hl>Result</> to Move Unit <hl>Target</>. The editor will create a local variable carrying the home target.": "設定撤退目標。從「返回原點」<hl>結果</>拖曳到「移動單位」<hl>目標</>。編輯器將建立一個局部變數來儲存返回原點目標。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Scout Range</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of Radar, which is the path used when no enemy was found.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>偵察範圍</>。將其拖曳到雷達的<hl>無結果</>圖釘上，該圖釘用於顯示未發現敵人時的路徑。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Scout Range <hl>Range</> to <hl>5</>. This controls how far the scout tries to move each time.": "將偵察範圍<hl>Range</>設定為<hl>5</>。這將控制偵察兵每次嘗試移動的距離。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Location</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Scout Range, as shown in the example graph. This records where the scout ended up after the move.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>取得位置</>。將其拖曳到偵察範圍的第一個/預設輸出引腳上，如範例圖所示。這將記錄偵察兵移動後的最終位置。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the scout's previous position. Drag from Get Location <hl>Coord</> to Scout Range <hl>Coord</>. The editor will create a local variable, so each new scout move can use the last location as direction context.": "將偵察兵的先前位置綁定到座標系。從「取得位置」<hl>座標</>拖曳到「偵察範圍」<hl>座標</>。編輯器將建立一個局部變量，以便每次新的偵察兵移動都可以使用上次的位置作為方向上下文。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the ends of <hl>Move Unit</> and <hl>Get Location</> unconnected. The behavior restarts after each branch, so it checks for enemies before every scout move.": "將<hl>移動單位</>和<hl>取得位置</>的端點保持斷開狀態。行為會在每個分支之後重新開始，因此它會在每次偵察移動之前檢查是否有敵人。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"tooltip": "工具提示", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"To watch the scout while testing, click <hl>View Options</> in the bottom-left camera preview and raise <hl>Show Behind Editor</>. This lets you monitor the unit behind the behavior editor as it runs.": "若要在測試時觀察偵察兵，請點選左下角攝影機預覽中的<hl>檢視選項</>，然後勾選<hl>顯示編輯器後方</>。這樣您就可以在行為編輯器運行時監控背後的單元。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the scout, and start or stop the behavior from the unit's behavior panel.": "按下“下一步”完成教程。退出行為編輯器，選擇偵察兵，然後從單位的行為面板啟動或停止該行為。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Signal-Controlled Move Behavior": "訊號控制移動行為", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds an event-driven behavior. A Radio Event waits for a radio signal on a chosen band; when the signal changes, the unit moves to the signal's target.": "本指南建構了一個事件驅動行為。無線電事件會等待選定頻段上的無線電訊號；當訊號改變時，設備會移動到訊號的目標位置。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Radio Event</> from the <hl>Communication</> category. Place it as a separate branch, not connected to Program Start.": "從<hl>通訊</>類別中新增<hl>無線電事件</>。將其放置在單獨的分支中，不要連接到“節目開始”分支。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set the Radio Event <hl>Band</> in the node body. Click its Band register and choose a value you will also use when sending the radio signal. If no band is selected, the event will not watch anything.": "在節點主體中設定無線電事件的<hl>頻段</>。按一下其頻段暫存器，並選擇您在發送無線電訊號時也會使用的值。如果未選擇頻段，則該事件將不會監聽任何內容。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Radio Event. Leave it set to <hl>Synchronous</>.": "從指令清單中新增<hl>移動單元</>。將其拖曳到無線電事件的第一個/預設輸出引腳上。將其設定為<hl>同步</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the signal target. Drag from the Radio Event <hl>Signal</> register to the Move Unit <hl>Target</> register. The signal should be a unit or coordinate target; the editor will create a local variable carrying it.": "連接訊號目標。將「無線電事件」暫存器中的 <hl>訊號</> 拖曳到「移動單元」暫存器中的 <hl>目標</> 。此訊號應為單位或座標目標；編輯器將建立一個局部變數來儲存它。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the end of <hl>Move Unit</> unconnected. The event branch finishes after moving, then waits for the next radio signal change on the selected band.": "將<hl>移動單元</>的末端保持斷開狀態。事件分支在移動後結束，然後等待所選頻段上的下一個無線電訊號變化。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the unit, and start the behavior. To test it, equip a <img id=\"c_radio_transmitter\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> on a different unit, set that radio behavior to the same band, then set coordinates on the radio; this bot will move to those coordinates when the radio signal changes.": "點選“下一步”完成教學。退出行為編輯器，選擇單元，然後啟動該行為。若要測試該行為，請在另一台單元上裝備一個<img id=\"c_radio_transmitter\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，將該單元的無線電行為設定為相同的頻段，然後在無線電上設定座標；當無線電訊號發生變化時，該機器人將移動到這些座標。", // <temporary automatic translation>

	// FILE: Main/ui/ui.lua
	"In the full version of Desynced, further exciting adventures and tech tree exploration awaits you!\n\nWe look forward to playing alongside you in the full version!": "在完整版《智械工廠 Desynced》中，更多激動人心的冒險與科技樹探索正等待著你！\n\n我們期待在完整版中與你並肩作戰！",
	"Start Over": "重新開始",
	"Do you want to start over?\n\nUse the menu to leave the game or switch to a different player faction.": "是否重新開始？\n\n使用菜單離開遊戲或切換至其他玩家陣營。",
	"Do you want to start over or leave the game and go back to the main menu?": "是否重新開始或離開遊戲並返回主選單？",
	"Dismiss": "忽略",
	"Leave Game": "離開遊戲",
	"cannot move into the blight": "無法進入枯萎區域",
	"Cannot move powered down unit": "無法移動斷電裝置",
	"No target for forced attack": "無強制攻擊目標",
	"<Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> - Force Attack\n<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\"/> - Attack Move": "<Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> - 強制攻擊\n<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\"/> - 攻擊移動",
	"<Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> - Force Attack": "<Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> - 強制攻擊",
	"Cannot queue action while Goto register is linked": "連結“前往”暫存器時無法進行排隊操作",
	"Cannot interact while Goto register is linked": "連結“前往”暫存器時無法進行交互",
	"Buildings cannot pick up items directly": "建築無法直接提取物品",
	"Set %s as store": "將%s設置為儲存",
	"Cleared store": "已清空儲存",
	"Pinged Here": "已在此處標記",
	"Player <header>%S</> pinged at <header>%dx%d</>": "玩家<header>%S</>在<header>%dx%d</>進行了標記",
	"Click: Select one unit or building on the map\nDrag: Select a group of units and buildings": "點擊：在地圖上選擇一個裝置或建築\n拖拽：選擇一組裝置和建築",
	"Move the selected unit(s) or give them a target": "移動選中裝置或設定目標",
	"Move Camera": "移動視角",
	"Move the camera by moving the mouse while holding down the button": "按住按鈕移動滑鼠移動攝影機",
	"Rotate Camera": "旋轉鏡頭",
	"Rotate the camera by moving the mouse while holding down the button": "按住按鈕旋轉滑鼠旋轉攝影機",
	"Move the selected combat unit(s) but attack encountered enemies": "移動選中作戰裝置並攻擊遭遇敵人",
	"Settings Copy": "設置複製",
