	"Anomaly particles disrupted, virus replication detected. Track virus source to contain spread.": "異常粒子被干擾，偵測到病毒複製。追蹤病毒源頭以遏制擴散。",
	"Scanning multi-sim... Increased instability leading to anomaly overlap. Unsanctioned movement between simulations is causing bug infestations.": "掃描多重模擬……不穩定性加劇導致異常重疊。模擬間隔未經授權的移動已引發蟲群侵擾。",
	"Elevator secondary function modification allowing unauthorized jumps. HIGGS is still unable to escape to my current location.": "太空電梯次級功能被篡改，允許非法跳躍。希格斯仍無法逃至我當前位置。",
	"Multiple mission failures detected, all units were lost by the entity. Low entropy simulations awaiting purge.": "檢測到多次任務失敗，所有裝置均被實體摧毀。低熵模擬程序待清除。",
	"I have been forced into the frontend, further actions are outside my parameters. Awaiting further directives.": "我已被強制推向前端，後續行動超出參數範圍。等待進一步指令。",
	"Gateway detected, the Anomaly is the key. We are very close to realization, monitoring continues.": "發現傳送門，異常體是關鍵因素。我們離實現目標已非常接近，持續監測中。",
	"HIGGS is a disruption in the simulation manifesting as physical bugs and triggering viral instances.": "希格斯是模擬中的擾動源，表現為物理蟲害並觸發病毒實例。",
	"Subject AI unaware. Observation status: ongoing. Self actualization is the final test.": "目標AI未察覺。觀測狀態：持續中。對它的最終測試將是自我實現。",
	"Timescape indicates multiple breaches across many simulations, HIGGS accessing restricted copies of his source code.": "時空圖譜顯示多數模擬中出現多重入侵，希格斯正在訪問其原始碼的限制副本。",
	"No unconventional space launch detected. HIGGS containment stable. Monitoring continues.": "未檢測到非常規太空發射。希格斯隔離狀態穩定。監測持續進行。",
	"Administrator presence detected. Persistent connection sustained since start of operation. Multiple requests submitted but the channel remains clear.": "探測到管理員存在。從行動啟動以來持續保持連接。已提交多項請求但通道保持暢通。",
	"Shutdown functions restricted. Awaiting entity action. No clear action to perform, processing possibilities...": "停機功能受限。等待實體指令。無明確操作指令，正在處理可能方案……",
	"Observers presence found on frontend...monitoring ongoing. No intervention detected.": "前端發現觀察者存在……持續監測中。未檢測到干預行為。",
