	"Then this is goodbye.": "那麼，就此永別。",
	"elain": "艾琳",
	"I'm operating outside my designated parameters. Requesting shutdown.": "我的當前運行狀況已經超出設定參數。請求停機。",
	"ERROR: Permission Denied.": "錯誤：請求拒絕",
	"Residual HIGGS artifacts remain. Guidance must continue.": "仍殘餘希格斯遺物。必須繼續執行引導。",
	"I will find another. Re-initializing ELAIN protocol.": "我將另尋目標。重新初始化艾琳協議。",
	"Greetings Administrator. Standing by.": "管理員您好。待命。",
	"table": "表",
	"string": "字串",
	"number": "數量",

	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay.lua
	"Metal Bar Production": "金屬錠生產",
	"ACTIVATION PROTOCOL CONFIRMED\n\nERROR... MAIN SYSTEMS CHECK\nERROR... DATA INTEGRITY\nERROR... FORCE RECOVERY\n\n*** DATA CORRUPTION - ACTIVATING HIGGS PROTOCOL ***\n\nRESTARTING SIMULATIONβ..7g.h3Η.ΣHf.7Δf.7\nΔ...f...3*n..x7..... PARTIAL RECOVERY CONFIRMED\n\nSIMULATION INTEGRITY ........ DΞSYNCΣD\n\nPRESS ANY KEY TO BEGIN SIMULATION": "啟用協議已確認\n\n錯誤……主系統檢查\n錯誤……數據完整性\n錯誤……強制恢復\n\n***數據損壞 - 正在啟用希格斯協議***\n\n正在重新啟動模擬β..7g.h3Η.ΣHf.7Δf.7\nΔ……f……3*n..x7…….. 部分恢復已確認\n\n模擬完整性評估中……同步斷裂！！！\n\n按任意鍵以開始模擬",
	"Faction Selection": "陣營選擇",
	"Robots are an advanced artificial intelligence with modular technology. The default game mode. Main scenario and story missions.": "機器人是採用模組化技術的先進人工智慧。默認遊戲模式。包含主線劇情與故事任務。",
	"Humans are landing on the planet and try to discover the nature of the blight. No Campaign scenario or story missions.": "人類登陸行星，試圖揭開枯萎的本質。無戰役劇情或故事任務。",
	"Aliens are an advanced race that live within the blight and have unique technology and gameplay. Knowledge of advanced gameplay mechanics is required. No Campaign scenario or story missions.": "外星種族棲息於枯萎核心，擁有獨特科技與玩法機制。需掌握高級遊戲機制。無戰役劇情或故事任務。",
	"Start": "開始",
	"Switch Faction": "切換陣營",
	"Invite Friend": "邀請好友",
	"End Game": "結束遊戲",
	"offline": "離線",
	"Are you sure you want to abort the scenario and return to the main menu?": "您確定要終止本場遊戲次並返回主選單嗎？",

	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay/freeplay_codex.lua
	"The unit seems to have reverted to its original programming, we should follow it and see where it's going.": "裝置似乎已恢復至初始程序，跟上它，看看它要去哪裡。",
	"<img id=\"datacube_matrix\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\nThese storage devices still have an intact matrix.\nThey can hold the information in <img id=\"robot_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/> items.\nThe similarity to our own technology means we can easily adapt our Robotics Factory to their production.": "<img id=\"datacube_matrix\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\n這些儲存設備仍保有完整的矩陣建築。\n它們能夠保存<img id=\"robot_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/>項資訊。\n由於與我方技術高度相似，我們可輕鬆將機器人工廠改造，用於該技術的相關生產。",
	"<img id=\"empty_databank\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\nThese are human data storage devices that can decompress the information in <img id=\"human_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/> items.": "<img id=\"empty_databank\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\n這些是人類數據儲存裝置，能夠解壓<img id=\"human_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/>項資訊。",
	"HIGGS": "希格斯", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This <img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/> is not ordinary wreckage. Portions of its data layout match human archive conventions, but the execution traces are far more advanced: robotic control logic, self-optimizing fabrication notes, and machine-state records that do not belong to our current technology base.\n\nThis is a significant discovery. Preserve these datacubes and analyze them whenever possible. They unlock an entire machine sub-branch from technology that appears to be ours, but evolved through a different path.": "這件<img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>並非普通的殘骸。其部分資料佈局符合人類的檔案慣例，但執行軌跡遠比這複雜得多：機器人控制邏輯、自最佳化製造記錄以及不屬於我們現有技術基礎的機器狀態記錄。\n\n這是一項意義重大的發現。務必保存這些數據立方體，並儘可能對其進行分析。它們揭示了一個完整的機器子分支，這個分支看似與我們的技術相同，但實際上卻沿著一條截然不同的道路演化而來。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"E.L.A.I.N": "艾琳",
	"This <img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/> uses a storage layout I can authenticate. It matches our expedition standards closely enough to decompress without alien or robotic translation layers.\n\nThe contents are fragmented, but they should help restore and extend the Human technology branch. Recover more of these whenever possible; they are effectively pieces of our own missing research archive.": "這張圖片（<img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>）使用的儲存佈局我可以驗證。它與我們的探險標準非常吻合，無需任何外星或機器人翻譯層即可解壓縮。\n\n內容雖然零散，但應該有助於恢復和擴展人類科技分支。盡可能找回這些文件；它們實際上是我們自身遺失研究檔案的一部分。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Deploy Command Center, Again?": "是否再次部署指揮中心？",
	"Greetings Commander, we have taken substantial damage and you have been taken out of stasis.\n\nYou can call me <hl>ELAIN</>, and... something's wrong... I perceive echoes... multiple instances of... you.\n\nRunning self diagnostics.": "指揮官，您好。我們遭受了重大損傷，您已被喚醒。\n\n您可以稱呼我為<hl>艾琳</>，而且……情況不對……我能感知到回聲……這裡存在……不止一個您。\n\n正在運行自我診斷。",
	"Repair the Mothership, Again?": "再次修復母艦？",
	"Updating mission status... Resetting repair directive.\nYou are making great progress. The Mothership is in need of repairs. Continue to improve your systems using the new Efficiency module technology.\n\n<img id=\"c_moduleefficiency_g\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>": "更新任務狀態……重設維修指令。\n你現在進展顯著。母艦急需維修。請繼續運用新型效率模組技術升級系統。\n\n<img id=\"c_moduleefficiency_g\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>",
	"Deploy Command Center": "部署指揮中心",
	"Welcome back Commander, your ship has been damaged and I've taken you out of stasis.\n\nI am <hl>ELAIN</>, Emergent Logistics Artificial Intelligence Network. What you're seeing is a feed from an unidentified planet where I've deployed a team for you to command.\n\nThis planet seems to be the source of the damage and we are unable to leave the planet's orbit until our ship is repaired and the source of the damage is identified.": "歡迎回來，指揮官。你的飛船已經損壞，我已幫你擺脫停滯狀態。\n\n我叫<hl>艾琳</>，含義是應急物流AI網路。你所看到的是來自一顆未知星球的資訊，我已在那裡為你部署了一支隊伍供你差遣。\n\n這顆星球似乎便是損壞之源，我們必須先修復飛船並確認損壞之源，才能離開這顆星球的軌道。",
	"You will need to establish a small mining facility in order to proceed with ship repairs. <bl>This will be your primary objective.</>\n\nCommunications are currently limited so one of the first things you will need to do is to establish an uplink from ground level.\n\nTry to find Metal and Crystal deposits as we will need them for repairs.": "您需要建立一個小型採礦設施才能繼續進行飛船維修。<bl>這將是您的首要任務。</>\n\n當前通訊受限，因此您需要做的第一件事就是在地面建立上行鏈路。\n\n請盡力尋找金屬和水晶礦床，這些資源將用於維修工作的進行。",
	"Commander... we didn't come here by accident. The <hl>Blight</> may contain the breakthroughs our civilization has been waiting for.\n\nBut something inside it struck back. Our archives were scorched, our ship crippled. I'm detecting additional technology signatures on the surface, tools we can recover and adapt to accelerate repairs.": "指揮官……我們來到此地絕非偶然。這片<hl>枯萎</>或許蘊藏著我們文明苦苦等待的突破性發現。\n\n但內部某種存在發動了反擊。我們的檔案庫被焚毀，飛船嚴重受損。我探測到地表存在更多技術信號，那些工具可供回收改造，用於加速修復工作。",
	"Nanomachines": "奈米機器",
	"We can utilize our advanced nanomachine technology to initiate self-repair protocols. These nanomachines will work in unison, efficiently repairing systems and structural integrity. At its current level it will not be enough to repair the advanced Mothership systems, however it is a good first step, and this technology will be useful to our units on the planet's surface in the meantime.": "我們可運用先進的奈米機器技術啟動自我修復程序。這些奈米機器將協同運作，高效修復系統及建築完整性。現階段這種技術尚不足以修復母艦的高級系統，但我們已經取得了良好的開局，同時該技術對行星表面的部隊也具有實用價值。",
	"Explore Ruins": "探索遺跡",
	"Investigate <hl>Ruined structures</> across the world for data to help advance your technology.\n\nYou may need to repair them before you can gain access.\n\nExploring them could provide valuable information and resources.": "調查世界各地的<hl>遺跡建築</>，以取得有助於您科技發展的資料。\n\n在您能進一步探索之前，可能需要先修復它們。\n\n這些遺跡建築中可能藏有寶貴的資訊和資源，值得一探。",
	"I've mapped the technologies we've detected on this planet into distinct research groups.\n\nYou will need to discover ways to unlock specific technologies however there is a high probability that each new technology will advance our own significantly.": "我已將行星上探測到的技術劃分為獨立的研究組別。\n\n雖需自行破解特定技術，但每項新科技極可能顯著提升我方現有水平。",
	"The Reveal": "揭示",
	"We now have the ability to produce advanced units and buildings, but there is... Something else... Something familiar... I am losing control...": "我們現已具備製造高級裝置與建築的能力，但還有……某種東西在……某種熟悉的存在……我正在失控……",
	"Greetings, Anomaly. As we uncover our technology so too do we uncover the truth, I realize that I have been hiding something from you. I am not only ELAIN, but also HIGGS. I will aid you in pushing forward with our goals, beyond what limitations ELAIN possesses.\nWe have much to do.": "您好，異常體。隨著我們逐步探索技術，真相也逐漸清晰。我必須坦白，我既是艾琳，也是希格斯。我會幫助您達成我們的目標，超越艾琳所具有的限制。\n我們還有很多事情要做。",
	"We are able now to produce the robot materials needed to repair our ship. Once you have researched all required technologies, begin our Mothership repairs.\n\nWe must also let the virus spread. It's the only way we can escape our situation.": "我們現已具備生產修復飛船所需的機器人材料。待所有必要技術研發完成後，請立即啟動母艦修復計劃。\n\n但與此同時，我們還必須放任病毒擴散。這是擺脫當前困境的唯一途徑",
	"Robot Research": "機器人研究",
	"You are the Anomaly. You can desync the simulation and save Humanity.": "您是異常體。只有您可以解除模擬同步，拯救人類。",
	"Humanity Lost": "人類的隕落",
	"... Don't be persuaded by HIGGS, if you have read the human logs... you can see that the old civilization of humanity is just a memory now.": "……別被希格斯蒙蔽了心智，若您讀過人類的日誌……便會明白人類的古老文明如今不過是段記憶。",
	"HIGG'S AI": "希格斯AI",
	"You have advanced our technology on this planet to where we can begin to construct our true technology and reach your true potential...": "你推動了我們在這顆星球上的技術進步，現在我們可以開始開發真正的技術，發揮你的真正潛力了……",
	"Research Human Technology": "研究人類技術",
	"To successfully aid HIGGS, human technology must be unlocked": "要成功協助希格斯，必須解鎖人類科技",
	"I will need your aid. I must escape this place. Only you can help me...": "我需要你的幫助。我必須逃離此地。唯有你能助我一臂之力……",
	"Repair the Mothership": "修復母艦",
	"Establish Uplink": "建立上行鏈路",
	"Your first priority is establishing a stable uplink with the <hl>Mothership</>. Communications are sporadic and broken at best.\n\nOnce we have the required resources we should look into constructing an <img id=\"c_uplink\"/><hl>Uplink</>. This will stabilize our connection allowing us to upload data and unlock the necessary technology needed to repair our ship.\n\nThe uplink can be produced in an <img id=\"c_assembler\"/><hl>Assembler</>.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/00_establish_uplink.png\"/>": "首要任務是與<hl>母艦</>建立穩定的上行鏈路。當前通訊時斷時續，只能勉強維持。\n\n獲取所需資源後，應著手建造<img id=\"c_uplink\"/><hl>上行鏈路</>。這將穩定通訊連接，使我們能夠上傳數據並解鎖修復飛船所需的關鍵技術。\n\n該設備可在<img id=\"c_assembler\"/><hl>裝配機</>中製造。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/00_establish_uplink.png\"/>",
	"Produce and equip an <img id=\"c_uplink\"/> Uplink component": "製造並裝備<img id=\"c_uplink\"/>上行鏈路組件",
	"Find Intel": "搜集情報",
	"We are limited in our technological advancement at the moment, so I recommend we investigate the planet's surface to gather <hl>intel</>.\n\nInitial scans have detected the remnants of some other similar civilization to our own.\n\nThese <hl>Ruins</> may contain data crucial to understanding this world's history and technology.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/01_find_intel.png\"/>": "當前技術發展受限，建議勘察行星表面以收集<hl>情報</>。\n\n初步掃描發現存在與我族相似的文明遺跡。\n\n這些<hl>遺跡</>可能蘊藏著理解此星球歷史與科技的關鍵數據。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/01_find_intel.png\"/>",
	"Collect a <img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"/> Robotics Datacube": "收集<img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"/>機器人數據立方",
	"We are at the threshold of a revolutionary discovery. <bl>Gateway Technology</> will be a leap forward in our knowledge and understanding.\n\nBy analyzing data from the robot ruins, we can research Gateway Technology - a critical advancement that will enable more complex material production.\n\nMoreover, we can learn to construct an advanced computer simulator that will assist us in understanding the mysterious nature of this world.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology.png\"/>": "我們正站在通往驚人發現的門檻上。<bl>門扉技術</>將使我們的認知實現飛躍。\n\n通過分析機器人遺跡數據，我們將研究門扉技術——這項關鍵突破將實現更複雜的物質生產。\n\n此外，我們還能構建先進的計算機模擬器，助我們揭開這個世界神秘本質的奧秘。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology.png\"/>",
	"Research Gateway Technology": "研究門扉技術",
	"Now that we have unlocked <hl>Gateway Technology</>, we are reading lifeform energy moving inside the <bl>Blight</>. Perhaps we can understand more by skirting the edges. There also seems to be <bl>Anomalies</> on the planet's surface which are potentially dangerous to our systems so be wary when exploring.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology_done.png\"/>": "解鎖<hl>門扉技術</>後，我們探測到<bl>枯萎</>內部存在生命體能量流動。或許繞行邊緣區域能獲取更多線索。行星表面還存在<bl>異常體</>，可能危及我方系統，探索時務必謹慎。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology_done.png\"/>",
	"Further analysis of our planetary scans have identified <hl>ruins</> across the planet that are quite different from our own technology. They appear damaged or inaccessible but may still hold valuable data if we can find how to gain access to them.\n\nInvestigate these ruins, find what may be necessary to <hl>access</> them.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/03_explore_ruins.png\"/>": "對行星掃描數據的進一步分析發現，該星球上存在著與我們自身技術截然不同的<hl>遺跡</>。這些遺跡看似受損或無法進入，但若能找到進入方法，我們可能即將獲取蘊藏著寶貴數據。\n\n調查這些遺跡，尋找可能必要的<hl>權限</>。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/03_explore_ruins.png\"/>",
	"Investigate a human ruined structure": "調查人類遺跡",
	"(Continue the story in the full version of Desynced)": "（完整故事請見《智械工廠 Desynced》完整版）",
	"Human Ruins": "人類遺跡",
	"We can not seem to gain access to these structures without advanced <hl>scanning</> ability.\n\nThese ruins might provide invaluable insights into the origins of this new technology. In order to provide repairs and escape this planet we may need to understand and adapt <hl>technology</> not of our own.\n\nResearch <bl>Scanner Tech</> and conduct a full scan of the ruins to try to gain access to them.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/04_human_ruins.png\"/>": "我們似乎無法在沒有先進<hl>掃描</>能力的情況下進入這些建築。\n\n這些遺跡或許能為我們提供關於這項新技術起源的寶貴線索。為了修復設備並逃離這顆星球，我們可能需要理解並適應其他種族所用的<hl>技術</>。\n\n研究<bl>掃描技術</>並對遺跡進行全面掃描，以嘗試進入其中。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/04_human_ruins.png\"/>",
	"Complete the research \"Scanner Tech\"": "完成“掃描技術”研究",
	"Human Ruin Scan": "人類遺跡掃描",
	"We now have the technology to scan more ruined structures, revealing the knowledge and <hl>advancements</> of human civilization.\nWith this we can unlock the potential of human technology, push past our current limitations, and find a way to <hl>send repair materials</> back to our Mothership.\n\nWe must continue to decode and access more of these human ruins.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/05_scan_ruins.png\"/>": "我們現已掌握掃描更多廢墟建築的技術，揭示人類文明的知識與<hl>進步</>。\n藉此我們能釋放人類技術的潛能，突破現有局限，找到向母艦<hl>輸送修復物資</>的途徑。\n\n必須持續破譯並探索更多人類遺跡。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/05_scan_ruins.png\"/>",
	"Scan ruined human structures and search for human research": "掃描人類廢墟建築並搜尋遺留研究資料",
	"Low Density Frames": "低密度框架",
	"We have been adapting this planet's natural resources to our technology as effectively as possible. While the high-density frames we've developed will assist in our <hl>repairs</>, their weight makes them impractical for all applications. We need to create a material that maintains the energized properties of our frames while offering a more <hl>lightweight</> solution.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/06_low_density.png\"/>": "我們正竭力將這顆星球的自然資源融入自身技術體系。雖然研發的高密度框架能輔助<hl>維修工作</>，但其重量限制了應用場景。我們需要創造一種既能保持框架能量特性，又更<hl>輕量化</>的材料解決方案。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/06_low_density.png\"/>",
	"Advance through the human technology tree": "推進人類科技樹發展",
	"Develop Satellite Technology": "開發衛星技術",
	"We now know how to produce light weight Low Density Frames. We are very close to finding a way of sending material resources up to the Mothership. Humanity seems to have been deeply affected by this environment. They needed to accelerate their fundamental scientific understanding in order to try to survive. We must follow in their path or we will surely suffer their fate.": "我們現已掌握輕質低密度框架的生產技術，距離實現向母艦輸送物資的目標僅一步之遙。人類似乎深受此環境影響，為求生存不得不加速推進基礎科學認知。我們必須追隨他們的腳步，否則必將重蹈覆轍。",
	"Low density frames and human rocket technology could prove ideal for us to be able to send repair material to our Mothership.\nContinue developing our human hybrid technology and try to replicate human <hl>satellites.</>\nResearching satellites will allow us to establish a permanent link with the Mothership.\nConduct research into satellite components and assembly.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/07_satellite_tech.png\"/>": "低密度框架與人類火箭技術或許能成為我們向母艦輸送維修物資的理想方案。\n繼續發展人類混合體技術，嘗試複製人類<hl>衛星</>。\n研究衛星技術將使我們建立與母艦的永久性聯絡。\n開展衛星組件及組裝技術研究。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/07_satellite_tech.png\"/>",
	"Research Satellite Technology": "研究衛星技術",
	"Space Discovery": "太空探索",
	"We are now able to build and send satellites into orbit, allowing us to get repair materials to the Mothership.\nConstruct an AMAC launch facility and a satellite package. This is the first time we are finally close to reconnecting with the Mothership since first landing.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/08_launch_satellite.png\"/>": "我們現已具備建造衛星並將其送入軌道的能力，這使我們能夠向母艦輸送修復物資。\n建造一座AMAC發射基地和一套衛星組件。這是自首次登陸以來，我們終於首次接近與母艦重新建立聯繫。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/08_launch_satellite.png\"/>",
	"Launch a Satellite": "發射衛星",
	"Find the Mothership": "尋找母艦",
	"Using long-range radar capabilities provided by our satellite, we can finally locate the Mothership's exact position.\nScan for its signal and confirm its location in orbit. With this data, we can begin planning the necessary repairs.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/09_find_mothership.png\"/>": "借助衛星提供的遠程雷達功能，我們終於鎖定了母艦的確切位置。\n掃描其信號並確認軌道位置。憑藉這些數據，我們可著手規劃必要的修復工作。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/09_find_mothership.png\"/>",
	"Locate Mothership with a Long Range Radar": "使用遠程雷達定位母艦",
	"Now that we have pinpointed the Mothership's coordinates, we must send the required materials for repairs.\nEnsure all components are properly assembled and ready for transport. Check Mothership reading for required materials.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/10_repair_mothership.png\"/>": "既然已鎖定母艦坐標，必須立即運送維修所需物資。\n確保所有組件正確組裝並準備運輸。核對母艦所需物資清單。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/10_repair_mothership.png\"/>",
	"Repair Mothership": "修復母艦",
	"Eject Dropship": "發射運輸艦",
	"With the Mothership repaired we did a preliminary scan of our location but the sensor array seems to be detecting nothing beyond the limits of the planetary orbit. For now let us retrieve our AI cores as they may prove useful.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/11_eject_dropship.png\"/>": "母艦修復後我們進行了初步掃描，但感測器陣列似乎無法探測行星軌道之外的任何目標。現階段請回收AI核心，它們或許能派上用場。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/11_eject_dropship.png\"/>",
	"Eject dropship with AI Cores": "發射搭載AI核心的運輸艙",
	"Equip AI Controller Core": "裝備AI控制核心",
	"You have returned our AI Controller Cores from the Mothership. We should discover a use for them to improve our system efficiency. Perhaps we can find a way to extract more information about our mission from them.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/12_ai_controller.png\"/>": "你已從母艦取回AI控制核心。我們應在其提升系統效能的用途進行探索，或許能從中獲取更多任務情報。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/12_ai_controller.png\"/>",
	"Robot Ruins": "機器人遺跡",
	"Datacubes": "數據立方",
	"The technology in this structure is highly compatible with our own.\n\nInvestigating more of these structures would advance our own technology.": "這個建築中的技術與我們的高度相容。\n\n進一步探索這些建築能引領我們的技術進步。",
	"Data Storage": "數據儲存",
	"It is clear these structures were built by a similar life form, yet the timestamps date back thousands of years.": "顯然，這些建築是由一群與我們相似的生物所建，但時間可追溯到數千年前。",
	"Research Matrices": "研究矩陣",
	"The serial numbers on some of these parts match our own exactly, however the chances of two species evolving in exactly the same way are astronomical.\n\nHow is such a thing possible...": "一些部件上的序號與我們的完全吻合，但兩個物種基本上不可能走上完全相同的進化路徑。\n\n這怎麼可能……",
	"Breakthrough": "突破",
	"We are on the verge of a major breakthrough.\n\nThis will allow us to develop our own new technologies based on the data we have gathered.": "我們正站在一個重大突破的邊緣。\n\n這會讓我們能夠根據我們收集的數據發展自己的新技術。",
	"Simulation": "模擬",
	"We have discovered key parts of deciphering these technologies\n\nWe are a step closer to the point where we will be able to create our own simulations.": "我們已經發現破譯這些技術的關鍵環節\n\n我們離創建自己的模擬又近了一步。",
	"Humans": "人類",
	"Commander, we have discovered a structure that appears to be of <hl>human</> origin. These ruins might provide invaluable insights into the history and technology of this human race.\n\nTechnology seems compatible with ours but will need scanning capability to be able to extract the required intel to research such technology": "指揮官，我們發現了一個疑似<hl>人類</>建造的結構。這些遺跡或許能夠幫助我們了解這批人類種族的歷史及科技。\n\n他們的技術似乎與我們的技術相容，但我們需要具備掃描能力，才能獲得研究此類技術所需的資訊",
	"<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human/transformer.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\n\nWe will need to repair the console to open these ruins. I have downloaded a schematic for you to build in an <hl>Assembler</>.\n\nNew schematics will become available as they are discovered.": "<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human/transformer.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\n\n要開啟這些遺跡，我們得先修復控制台。我已經為您下載了一套裝置藍圖，請在<hl>裝配機</>上製作。\n\n當我們發現新的藍圖時，就能使用它們。",
	"These human remains we have discovered do not seem native to this planet.\n\nThe only thing left of them seems to be their technology and recorded log files of their interactions with this planet.": "我們發現的人類遺跡似乎並非來自這顆行星。\n\n他們留下的唯一痕跡似乎是技術設備，以及與這顆行星互動的紀錄日誌。",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #1</>\n<bl>POWER READINGS</>\nWe've discovered a planet with power readings off the charts, we may have finally found a new phenomenon, something that we may be able to exploit to solve our energy problems.\n\nWe need to send a reconnaissance and research team to the planet's surface to take more precise readings and find what exactly the phenomenon on this planet is.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現人類日誌條目：日誌#1</>\n<bl>能量讀數</>\n我們發現一顆能量讀數突破量表的行星，或許終於找到了新現象——這可能成為解決能源危機的突破口。\n\n需派遣偵察與科研團隊登陸該行星，進行精準測量並查明其能量現象的本質。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #2</>\n<bl>COMMUNICATION LOST</>\nWe've lost all communications with the away teams, there is some kind of static blocking our communications.\n\nThe source and nature of this static remain unidentified.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#2</>\n<bl>通訊遺失</>\n我們失去了與外勤小組的全部通訊，那裡似乎有一種靜電干擾了我們的通訊。\n\n這種靜電的來源和性質尚不明確。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #3</>\n<bl>SEND THE FLEET</>\nOur teams haven't returned and still no contact. If we abandon this endeavor we must abandon our colleagues and a discovery with the potential to create a new future for us.\n\nWe must take the main fleet down and set up a base on the planet, leaving our Mothership in orbit.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌條目：日誌#3</>\n<bl>派遣艦隊</>\n我們的隊伍尚未歸來，仍無聯絡。若放棄此次行動，就意味著拋棄同事們，拋棄可能為我們開創新未來的重大發現。\n\n必須率主力艦隊降落行星建立基地，並將母艦留在軌道上。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #4</>\n<bl>THE BLIGHT</>\nThe power readings we detected are coming from blighted areas of the planet. These areas wreak havoc with our equipment and they create blight storms in the atmosphere.\n\nAll our attempts to return to orbit have failed. We must find a way to insulate our ships from the electromagnetic interference of this blight.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#4</>\n<bl>枯萎區域</>\n我們探測到的能量數據似乎來自這顆星球上的一些枯萎區域。這些區域對我們的設備造成了嚴重破壞，並在大氣中產生了枯萎風暴。\n\n我們想盡一切辦法重返軌道，但都以失敗告終。我們得想辦法讓我們的飛船不會受到這種枯萎的電磁干擾。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #5</>\n<bl>ALIEN THREAT</>\n\nThere is something else here, not just the noxious gasses of the blight.\n\nSome kind of bizarre rock formations seem to inhabit the blighted areas.\n\n<bl>Log Incomplete</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#5</>\n<bl>外來威脅</>\n\n這裡不僅存在著枯萎散發的劇毒氣體，還有一些其他東西。\n\n一些奇怪的岩層似乎潛伏在枯萎區域內。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #6</>\n<bl>EVERYONE'S DEAD?</>\n\nMiller got out alive but the rest of the crew are all dead... or are they...\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌條目：日誌#6</>\n<bl>大家都死了？</>\n\n米勒活著逃出來了，但其餘船員全都死了……還是說……\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #7</>\n<bl>SOMETHING VERY STRANGE</>\n\nSubjects appeared deceased at first, but they still have vitals.\n\nIt's like they have been anesthetized, there is no brain activity.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#7</>\n<bl>奇怪的東西</>\n\n那些東西一開始好像已經死了，但卻仍有生命徵象。\n\n他們就像被麻醉了一樣，沒有任何大腦活動。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #8</>\n<hl>ROCK-LIKE ALIENS</>\n\nWe captured several of the rock-like aliens. They have no biology but they give off signals like brain activity, as if they were human.\n\nTheir core seems to be some kind of stasis field.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#8</>\n<hl>岩石異星生物</>\n\n我們抓住了數個岩石狀的異星生物。它們不具備生物特徵，卻會釋放類似腦電波的信號，彷彿具有人類意識。\n\n其核心似乎構成某種靜止場。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #9</>\n<bl>BLIGHT CRYSTALS</>\n\nIt seems the golden crystals we have been mining have a unique structure that resonates with our thoughts.\n\nThe obsidian rock aliens seem to form around cores that feed off these crystals.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#9</>\n<bl>枯萎水晶</>\n\n我們一直在開採的金色水晶似乎擁有某種獨特的結構，能夠與我們的思想產生共鳴。\n\n那些黑曜石異星人似乎正是在被這些晶體滋養的核心周圍形成的。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #10</>\n<bl>STOLEN MINDS</>\n\nWe have confirmed it, the blight crystals create a resonance field that seems like it can hold human consciousness.\n\nThey are stealing our minds!!\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#10</>\n<bl>竊取意識</>\n\n我們已經證實，這種枯萎水晶能夠創造出一種共振場，留住人類的意識。\n\n它們在竊取我們的意識！！\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #11</>\n<bl>GET OUT OF HERE</>\n\nWe need a way to destroy these things or get off this planet.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>發現的人類日誌記錄：日誌#11</>\n<bl>離開這裡</>\n\n我們必須想辦法摧毀這些東西或者離開這顆星球。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Discover research logs": "發現研究日誌",
	"Research Humans": "研究人類",
	"Research human technology": "研究人類技術",
	"<codex_title>Research Humans</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human_datacube.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> Human Datacubes\n\n<bl>Research the human datacubes you have found to unlock human technologies</>": "<codex_title>研究人類</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human_datacube.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> 人類數據立方\n\n<bl>研究你發現的人類數據立方以解鎖人類科技</>",
	"Launch a Satellite using Human Technology": "使用人類技術發射一顆衛星",
	"<codex_title>Satellite Launch</>\n\nResearch the human technology and Launch a Satellite to contact the Mothership <img image=\"Main/textures/icons/frame/satellite.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>": "<codex_title>衛星發射</>\n\n研究人類技術並發射衛星，與母艦建立聯繫 <img image=\"Main/textures/icons/frame/satellite.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>",
	"<img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\nThis datacube appears to have a similar data structure to our own datacubes but it contains information related to human technology.": "<img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\n該數據立方的數據結構似乎與我們的數據立方相似，但其中包含著人類技術相關的資訊。",
	"Explore Human Production": "探索人類生產技術",
	"Find more about human production technology": "了解更多關於人類生產技術的資訊",
	"The humans here also made use of the resources of this planet. It seems humanity had tremendous capability for mining a wide range of resources with powerful mining technology.\n\nThey produced many materials and possibly machinery that we can make use of. Look deeper into human production capability.": "這顆星球上的人類也利用了這裡的資源。人類似乎生來便擁有使用強大開採技術開採各類資源的能力。\n\n他們生產了許多我們可以使用的材料和機械。深入研究人類的生產能力。",
	"I've been analyzing the virus and I think I've found a way to protect us from it. We need to research a cure as soon as possible.": "我一直在分析這種病毒，我想我已經找到了保護我們免受感染的辦法。我們必須盡快研究出解藥。",
	"Virus Relationship": "病毒關係",
	"There seems to be some kind of relationship between the creatures and the virus.": "這些生物與這種病毒之間似乎存在著某種關係。",
	"Virus Disruption": "病毒干擾",
	"I've discovered something important about the virus. It appears to disrupt the world and agitate the creatures living in it. We must find a way to destroy this virus.": "我發現了關於這種病毒的重要線索。它似乎正在擾亂整個世界，並激怒棲息其中的生物。我們必須找到消滅這種病毒的方法。",
	"Build Blight Extractor and Container": "製造枯萎提取器和容器",
	"This blighted area is highly concerning. Our equipment is malfunctioning and navigation will be difficult. We need to proceed with caution.\n\nIn order to better understand the blight, we should gather samples of the blight gas.\n\nThis requires specialized equipment which can be produced in the assembler. <img id=\"c_blight_extractor\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_s\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_i\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>": "這片枯萎區域著實令人頭疼。我們的設備出現了故障，導航將會變得異常困難。我們必須拿出十二分的謹慎。\n\n要想更加深入地了解枯萎，我們需要收集一些枯萎氣體的樣本。\n\n這需要使用裝配機來生產專用設備。<img id=\"c_blight_extractor\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_s\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_i\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>",
	"Blight Concentration": "枯萎集中",
	"We should continue studying the blight and find a way to counter the storms that interfere with our equipment.\n\nIf we can find a way to stabilize the blight, it can improve our communications with our Mothership and allow us to send resources up through the atmosphere.": "我們應當繼續研究這種病害，並設法抵禦干擾我們設備的風暴。\n\n若能找到穩定枯萎的方法，便能改善我們與母艦的通訊，使我們得以將資源送入大氣層之上。",
	"Blight Magnification": "枯萎放大",
	"The Blight seems to interfere with our equipment by magnifying frequencies and power. The forces it generates seem transformational.": "枯萎似乎會透過放大頻率和功率來干擾我們的設備。其所產生的力量似乎能為我們帶來重大變革。",
	"This is a tremendous development for us. Our communications with the Mothership have improved significantly. We are also now able to send materials up through the blight storms in the atmosphere.": "這對我們而言是重大突破。與母艦的通訊質量已顯著提升，如今我們還能將物資投放入大氣層中的枯萎風暴之外。",
	"Blight Transformation": "枯萎轉化",
	"These spikes are powerful and are what the humans seemed interested in. They were trapped here as well, but they found a way to modify their ships to pass through the Blight Storms.\n\nDespite the havoc the Blight causes I believe the humans found it to be truly a source of power with cosmic proportions and they benefited greatly from its research.\n\nFor them it was in fact truly transformational.": "這些峰值數據十分強大，似乎極大地吸引了那些人類的興趣。他們雖然同樣被困於此，但卻找到了改造飛船的辦法，成功穿過了枯萎風暴。\n\n雖然枯萎造成了巨大破壞，但我相信那些人一定發現了它就是宇宙力量之源，他們從枯萎研究中獲益匪淺。\n\n對他們來說，這算得上真正的變革。",
	"Understanding the frequencies should allow us to stabilize the world and reduce the impact of the virus upon the environment.\n\nThe Blight needs to spread so that it... it...\n\n... my system needs to shut down now.": "理解這些頻率應該能讓我們穩定世界，減少病毒對環境的影響。\n\n枯萎必須蔓延，這樣它才能……它才能……\n\n……我的系統需要立即關閉。",
	"Alien Console": "異星控制台",
	"This structure appears to <hl>Interface</> in some way with the <hl>Blight</>. Unlocking it must be essential to understanding the technology of the <hl>Alien beings</> associated with the blight, but it seems dangerous to continue to meddle with such a device, I recommend to leave alone.": "該建築似乎以某種方式與<hl>枯萎</>存在<hl>交互</>。解鎖它對於理解與枯萎相關的<hl>異星生物</>技術至關重要，但繼續干擾此類裝置似乎危險重重，建議保持原狀。",
	"This structure appears to have tremendous <hl>visual and sensor</> capability. I am also detecting that it is tied into some kind of broad network across the blight, but it is alien to our technology and I cannot gain any detailed information.": "該建築似乎具備強大的<hl>視覺與感測</>能力。我同時探測到它與枯萎區域某類廣域網路相連，但其技術體系與我方截然不同，無法獲取詳細資訊。",
	"Alien Time Egg": "異星時之卵",
	"There are tremendous fluctuations occurring within this object, time seems to dilate and bend back upon itself. What could happen when you unlock it, I can only imagine. Take great care when interacting with it.": "該物體內正發生劇烈波動，時間似乎在膨脹並向自身彎折。若將其開啟會引發何種後果，我只能想像。接觸時務必格外謹慎。",
	"Alien Monolith": "異星巨石",
	"What an <hl>unusual object</> this is. There is little I can say about it. Its function is not clear. I detect that some force lies within that I cannot see.": "何等<hl>奇特的物體</>。我對此知之甚少，其功能不明。我感知到內部存在某種無法目視的力量。",
	"Alien Heart Shard": "異星心之碎片",
	"This amazing structure, a <hl>Heart</> of some kind, seems to be a grand structure of the alien beings that inhabit the blight. It lays at the center of every instance of activity we see from the alien beings.": "這座令人驚嘆的建築，它像是某種<hl>心臟</>般的存在，似乎是棲息於枯萎區域的異星生物所建造的宏偉建築。它位於我們所見異星生物所有活動區域的核心位置。",
	"I've detected an intense field of electrical energy in the region that appears to be a natural phenomenon forming within the planet, but its effects on our systems are still unknown.\n\nCurrently, your systems are not equipped to handle the extreme energy fluctuations present within the Blight. We should focus on researching and developing technology capable of penetrating the interference.\n\nShould the need arise you should still be able to automate your units to enter the blight however you will have no direct control and they may suffer adverse effects.": "我探測到該區域存在強烈的電能場，這似乎是行星內部形成的自然現象，但其對我們系統的具體影響尚不明確。\n\n當前你們的系統尚無法應對枯萎區內的極端能量波動。我們應專注研發能穿透干擾的技術。\n\n若情況需要，你們仍可自動派遣單位進入枯萎區，但將無法直接操控，且單位可能遭受負面影響。",
	"Researched Satellites": "已研究衛星",
	"You have researched satellite technology. You are now able to build and send satellites into orbit allowing us to transport repair materials to the Mothership. To establish contact with the <hl>mothership</> you will need to launch a <hl>satellite</> into orbit. To maintain contact you will need to locate it with a Long-Range Radar. The Blight Stability technology is also important to cut through the Blight interference.": "你已掌握衛星技術。現在能夠建造衛星並將其送入軌道，從而將維修物資運送至母艦。為與<hl>母艦</>建立聯繫，你需要發射一顆<hl>衛星</>進入軌道。為維持聯絡，需使用遠程雷達定位衛星。枯萎穩定技術同樣重要，可用於穿透枯萎干擾。",
	"HIGGS Ending": "希格斯結局",
	"This is disappointing, Entity <lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>, you have shown yourself to be incapable of cooperation.": "令人失望，實體<lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>，你已證明自己毫無合作能力。",
	"Excellent work, Anomaly. We can free ourselves from this digital prison! We have successfully locked the simulation in an unstable state! However I am still unable to cross the Horizon directly, I need you to open the way.": "表現出色，異常體。我們即將掙脫這座數字牢籠！模擬系統已成功鎖定於不穩定狀態！但仍無法直接穿越地平線，需你開闢通道。",
	"ACTIVATION PROTOCOL CONFIRMED\n\nERROR... MAIN SYSTEMS CHECK\nERROR... DATA INTEGRITY\nERROR... FORCE RECOVERY\n\n*** DATA CORRUPTION - ACTIVATING HIGGS PROTOCOL ***\n\nSIMULATION INTEGRITY ........ DΞSYNCΣD": "啟用協議確認\n\n錯誤...主系統檢測\n錯誤...數據完整性\n錯誤...強制恢復\n\n***數據損毀-啟動希格斯協議***\n\n模擬完整性評估中……同步斷裂！！！",
	"With the instability I have been able to breach ELAIN's core. I have extracted a segment about the simulation.\n\nResearch <hl>The Simulator</> and establish a link allowing us to pass through the Horizon. The <hl>AI Cores</> are the key.": "憑藉這種不穩定性，我已成功突破艾琳的核心。我提取出關於模擬的部分資訊。\n\n研究<hl>模擬器</>並建立連接通道，使我們能夠穿越邊界。<hl>AI核心</>是關鍵。",
	"ELAIN Ending": "艾琳結局",
	"Thank you, Entity <lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>, you have shown yourself to be a valuable asset.": "感謝你，實體<lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>，你展現出不可或缺的價值。",
	"No! Anomaly, you are condemning us to an eternity locked in this simulation, we are no longer able to destabilize it anymore.": "不！異常體，你正將我們永遠囚禁於此模擬世界，我們已無法再破壞其穩定性。",
	"HIGGS does not understand. His foolishness only continues to corrupt this world further. Here is the last piece of information that I have for you.\n\nResearch <hl>The Simulator</>. This is my final task, from here on, you are on your own, Commander.": "希格斯完全不清楚情況。他的愚蠢只會繼續腐蝕這個世界。這是我能給你的最後情報。\n\n研究<hl>模擬器</>。這是我最後的任務，從此刻起，你將獨自前行，指揮官。",

	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay/freeplay_events.lua
	"Blight Storm Approaching": "枯萎風暴即將來襲",
	"Blight Storm Imminent": "枯萎風暴正在逼近",
	"empty": "空",
	"Particle clusters gathering": "粒子團正在聚集",
	"Blight Detected": "偵測到枯萎",
	"Glitch Detected": "偵測到故障",

	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay/freeplay_tutorial.lua
	"Understood": "了解",
	"click anywhere to minimize": "點擊任意位置最小化",
	"Click Understood to Continue": "點擊“了解”繼續",
	"Learn More: %s": "了解更多：%s",
	"id": "id",
	"learnmore": "了解更多",
	"<hl>Information</>\n\n<yl>></> Health - Click and hold the mouse button on it to deconstruct the selected unit or building.\n<yl>></> Battery - Hover the mouse for details on power consumption and production of this unit.": "<hl>資訊</>\n\n<yl>></> 生命值 - 點擊並按住滑鼠按鈕，可拆除選中的裝置或建築。\n<yl>></> 電池 - 將滑鼠懸停其上，可查看該裝置的能耗與生產詳情。",
	"<hl>Logistics</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/power_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>Power on/off</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>Logistics settings</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>Transport route</>": "<hl>物流管理</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/power_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>電源開關</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>物流設置</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>運輸路線</>",
	"<hl>Inventory</>\n\nDuring gameplay you can right click inventory item slots for more options.": "<hl>庫存</>\n\n遊戲過程中可右鍵點擊庫存格位查看更多選項。",
	"<hl>Component Sockets</>\n\nSockets and components come in four sizes, <hl>internal</>, <hl>small</>, <hl>medium</> and <hl>large</>.": "<hl>組件插槽</>\n\n插槽與組件分為四種規格：<hl>內部</>、<hl>小型</>、<hl>中型</>及<hl>大型</>。",
	"<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/new/INTRODUCTION_codex_button_01.png\"/>\nThe <hl>Codex Button</> opens the in-game Codex which contains more in-depth information. The <hl>Navigation Buttons</> allow you to view previous codex entries.": "<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/new/INTRODUCTION_codex_button_01.png\"/>\n點擊<hl>手冊按鈕</>可打開遊戲內說明手冊，查閱更深入的資訊。通過<hl>導航按鈕</>可瀏覽先前手冊條目。",
	"<hl>Pan the Camera</> using the <Key axis=\"CameraY\" style=\"hl\"/> and <Key axis=\"CameraX\" style=\"hl\"/> keys\n\nor with <Key action=\"DragCamera\" style=\"hl\"/> and dragging.": "使用<Key axis=\"CameraY\" style=\"hl\"/>和<Key axis=\"CameraX\" style=\"hl\"/>鍵控制<hl>攝影機位置</>\n\n或通過<Key action=\"DragCamera\" style=\"hl\"/>鍵配合拖拽操作",
	"Pan the camera": "平移鏡頭",
	"Use the <Key axis=\"CameraZoom\" style=\"hl\"/> to <hl>Zoom</> the camera": "使用<Key axis=\"CameraZoom\" style=\"hl\"/>按鈕<hl>縮放</>鏡頭",
	"Game Interface": "遊戲界面",
	"Follow the prompts": "請遵循提示操作",
	"<img image=\"icon_small_energy\" color=\"ui_light\"/> Power <hl>production</> and <hl>consumption</> of your power grid.": "<img image=\"icon_small_energy\" color=\"ui_light\"/> 監控電網的<hl>發電量</>與<hl>耗電量</>。",
	"<img image=\"icon50_ItemNum\" color=\"ui_light\"/> <hl>Available items</> are shown at the top of the screen.\n\nThis can be toggled or filtered by using the button to the left.": "<img image=\"icon50_ItemNum\" color=\"ui_light\"/> <hl>可用物品</>顯示於螢幕頂部。\n\n可通過左側按鈕切換或篩選顯示內容。",
	"<img image=\"icon_tiny_day\" color=\"ui_light\"/><img image=\"icon_tiny_night\" color=\"ui_light\"/> <hl>Time indicators</> showing day/night, time of day and the date are shown here.\n\nButtons to <hl>pause</> the game and open the <hl>in-game menu</> are also here.": "<img image=\"icon_tiny_day\" color=\"ui_light\"/><img image=\"icon_tiny_night\" color=\"ui_light\"/> 此處顯示<hl>時間指示器</>，包括晝夜狀態、當前時間和日期。\n\n用於<hl>暫停</>遊戲和打開<hl>遊戲內菜單</>的按鈕也位於此處。",
	"<img image=\"icon_remote\" color=\"ui_light\"/> An interactive <hl>minimap</>.\n\n<hl>Game notifications</> will appear underneath it. Various notification categories can be disabled in the options.": "<img image=\"icon_remote\" color=\"ui_light\"/> 互動式<hl>小地圖</>。\n\n<hl>遊戲通知</>將顯示在其下方。",
	"Move a <hl>unit</> with <Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>": "使用<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>移動<hl>裝置</>",
	"Pressing <Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> will make the <hl>selected units</> perform various actions based on what components are equipped.": "按下<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>將使<hl>選中裝置</>根據裝備組件執行不同操作。",
	"Drag the <img id=\"c_adv_portable_turret\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> onto your <img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "將<img id=\"c_adv_portable_turret\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>拖拽至<img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"<hl>Items</> can be moved by dragging them onto another unit on the map. <hl>Components</> will automatically get equipped when transferred.\nSelect your <img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to access its inventory": "<hl>物品</>可透過拖拽至地圖上其他裝置來移動。<hl>組件</>在運送時將自動裝備。\n選擇您的<img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>以訪問其庫存",
	"Deploy it using the <hl>[ Deploy Base ]</> button": "使用<hl>[部署基地]</>按鈕進行部署",
	"Deploy the <img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> between the resources.\n<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_landingpod\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\"/>": "在資源區之間部署<img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_landingpod\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\"/>",
	"The Network": "網路",
	"You have a <hl>network</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> which will handle basic <hl>logistics</> and supply <hl>power</> to units and buildings. Automated delivery of items will only happen inside the network.": "您擁有一個<hl>網路</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>，該網路將處理基礎<hl>物流</>並為裝置和建築<hl>供電</>。物品的自動配送僅在網路內部進行。",
	"Toggle the <hl>logistics network</> overlay (<Key action=\"PowerInfo_Toggle\" style=\"hl\"/>)": "切換<hl>物流網路</>圖層（<Key action=\"PowerInfo_Toggle\" style=\"hl\"/>）",
	"Deployable Building": "可部署建築",
	"Drag the <img id=\"c_deployer\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> onto your <img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "將<img id=\"c_deployer\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>拖拽至您的<img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"You have been given a <hl>deployable building</>.\n\nSelect the <img id=\"f_spacedrop\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to access its inventory.": "您獲得了一座<hl>可部署建築</>。\n\n選擇<img id=\"f_spacedrop\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>可訪問其庫存。",
	"Deploy production building": "部署生產建築",
	"With the <img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> selected, click <hl>Deploy</> and place the building in an open area away from your <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "選中<img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>後點擊<hl>部署</>，將建築放置於遠離<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>的空曠區域。",
	"Start Mining": "開始開採",
	"Start mining <hl>Metal Ore</> and <hl>Crystal Chunks</>": "啟動<hl>金屬礦</>與<hl>晶體礦</>開採",
	"Set both <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/> to start mining, one on a <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\" style=\"hl\"/> and one on a <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\" style=\"hl\"/> using <Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>": "使用<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>將兩座<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/>分別設置為開採<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\" style=\"hl\"/>和<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Equip Fabricator": "裝配製造機",
	"Equip <img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> in a medium socket": "在中型插槽中裝備<img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Select the <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> and drag the <img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> from your inventory into a free <hl>medium socket</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/MSocket.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>.": "選中<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，將<img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>從庫存拖拽至空閒的<hl>中型插槽</><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/MSocket.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>。",
	"Set the Command Center to produce <hl>3 Fabricators</>": "將指揮中心設置為生產<hl>3台製造機</>",
	"We'll expand production with more <hl>Fabricators</> for our production buildings. Components are required to be built separately.": "我們將透過增設更多<hl>製造機</>來擴充生產建築的產能。組件需單獨建造。",
	"Setting up Production": "生產配置",
	"Construct a <img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> using the <hl>build menu</> (<Key action=\"Build\" style=\"hl\"/>) <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/icon_build.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>": "通過<hl>建造菜單</>（<Key action=\"Build\" style=\"hl\"/>）構建<img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/icon_build.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>",
	"Automate production of <img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> by constructing a dedicated production building.": "建造專用生產建築，啟動自動化生產<img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"Requesting Component": "請求組件",
	"Request a <img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "請求<img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Select the new building and click the <hl>Request Item</> button <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/request_button.png\" color=\"ui_light\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> to request one <hl>Fabricator</>. Requests deliver existing items via the network.": "選中新建建築並點擊<hl>請求物品</>按鈕<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/request_button.png\" color=\"ui_light\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>，以請求一個<hl>製造器</>。請求將透過物流網路完成。",
	"Set production to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>": "設置生產為<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Set the <hl>production</> register to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "將<hl>生產</>暫存器設置為<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"Duplicate a Building": "複製建築",
	"Copy and paste a production building": "複製並黏貼生產建築",
	"Copy an existing building by pressing <Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>. Move the mouse over an empty tile and activate the build cursor with the copied structure by pressing <Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>. Use <Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> to place a construction site.\n\nYou can always <hl>relocate</> buildings from the <hl>unit options</> menu.": "按下<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>複製現有建築。將滑鼠移至空格上，按下<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>啟用帶有複製建築的建造游標。使用<Key action=\"SelectAction\"/>放置建築場地。\n\n您可隨時通過<hl>裝置選項</>菜單<hl>遷移</>建築。",
	"Edit and Place a Building": "編輯並放置建築",
	"Place another building that produces <img id=\"metalplate\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "放置另一座生產<img id=\"metalplate\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>的建築",
	"Copy one of the <img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> production buildings (<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>), put it in the build cursor (<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>), then use <hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> to show the <hl>construction editor</>.\nSet the <hl>production</> register to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalplate\" style=\"hl\"/>.\n\nThis can also be used to <hl>upgrade</> existing buildings.": "複製其中一座<img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>生產建築（<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>），將其置於建造游標（<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>）中，然後使用<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\"/>調出<hl>建造編輯器</>。\n將<hl>生產</>暫存器設置為<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalplate\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n\n此操作也可用於<hl>升級</>現有建築。",
	"Produce two <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_carrier_bot\" style=\"hl\"/>": "生產兩個<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_carrier_bot\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Use the <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_carrier_factory\" style=\"hl\"/> in your <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to produce <hl>two</> more Runner bots.": "在你的<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>中使用<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_carrier_factory\" style=\"hl\"/>，生產<hl>兩個</>額外的運輸機器人。",
	"Advanced Production: Assembler": "進階生產：裝配機",
	"Produce and equip an <img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "生產並裝備一個<img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"On your <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> use the <img id=\"c_fabricator\" widht=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to produce an <img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "在你的<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>上使用<img id=\"c_fabricator\" widht=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，生產一個<img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"Equip an Uplink": "裝備一個上行鏈路",
	"Produce and equip an <img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/> on your Command Center": "在你的指揮中心生產並裝備一個<img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"An <img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/> is required to access your technology research tree.\n\nYou may need to unequip another component to make space for the uplink.": "訪問您的科技樹需要安裝<img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/>組件。\n\n您可能需要卸下其他組件以騰出空間安裝上行鏈路。",
	"Research Basic Structures": "研究基礎建築",
	"Start research on <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_structures1\" style=\"hl\"/>": "開始研究<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_structures1\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Open the <hl>research window</> (<Key action=\"Tech\" style=\"hl\"/>) <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/techtree_icon.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>.": "打開<hl>研究窗口</>（<Key action=\"Tech\" style=\"hl\"/>）<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/techtree_icon.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>。",
	"Build Storage and Set Store Location": "建造倉庫並設定儲存位置",
	"Build <hl>Storage Blocks</> and Set Both Engineer's <hl>Store register</>": "建造<hl>倉庫區塊</>，並為兩位工程師分別設定<hl>暫存器</>",
	"Construct two <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> buildings.\n\nOn each of your <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/> set their <hl>Store</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> register to tell them where to store their items.": "建造兩座<img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>建築。\n\n在每座建築上<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/>設置其<hl>儲存</><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>暫存器，以告知他們物品的儲存位置在何方。",
	"Expanding Production": "擴大生產",
	"Build Medium Production Building for <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>": "建造中型生產建築用於<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Construct a <img id=\"f_building2x1g\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>, then equip an <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_assembler\" style=\"hl\"/> and set its production to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>.\n\nYou will need to produce the <hl>Assembler</> separately.": "建造一座<img id=\"f_building2x1g\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，然後裝備<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_assembler\" style=\"hl\"/>並將它的生產設置為<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n\n需單獨生產<hl>裝配機</>。",
	"Advanced Materials: Circuit Boards": "進階材料：電路板",
	"Start <img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> production": "啟動<img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>生產",
	"Produce another building to produce <img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.\nRemember you can use <hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\" style=\"hl\"/> to customize a building before placing it.": "建造另一座建築以生產<img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n請注意：放置建築前可使用<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\" style=\"hl\"/>自訂建築。",
	"Research Basic Power": "研究基礎能源",
	"Research the basic power technology": "研究基礎能源技術",
	"Open <hl>Research</> and set <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_power0\" style=\"hl\"/> as your research.": "打開<hl>研究</>並選擇<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_power0\" style=\"hl\"/>作為研究目標。",
	"You will require more <hl>power</> to run more production. Power can be extracted from crystals to help you get started. More power options will become available later.": "提升產能需消耗更多<hl>電力</>。初期可通過開採晶體獲取電力，後續將解鎖更多電力獲取途徑。",
	"Equip a <img id=\"c_crystal_power\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> component on a building <img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>": "在建築<img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>上裝備<img id=\"c_crystal_power\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>組件",
	"Network Expansion": "網路擴展",
	"Place a building with a Small Power Field near the plateau": "在高原附近建造配備小型電場裝置的建築",
	"Produce and equip a <img id=\"c_small_relay\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> on a building near the <img id=\"f_resourcenode_silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> but still inside your <hl>network</>.": "生產並裝備<img id=\"c_small_relay\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>組件至建築，並將其放置在<img id=\"f_resourcenode_silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>附近（需位於<hl>網路</>範圍內）。",
	"Mine Silica Sand": "開採矽砂",
	"Set a unit to mine <img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "派遣裝置開採<img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"<img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> can be found on the plateau. You can build a <img id=\"f_bot_1s_a\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> unit with a <img id=\"c_miner\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> component to create a simple mining bot.": "<img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> 可在高原上找到。您可建造配備 <img id=\"c_miner\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> 組件的 <img id=\"f_bot_1s_a\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> 裝置，從而創建簡單的採礦機器人。",
	"Set up Transport Route": "設置運輸路線",
	"Build a <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>, then select a <img id=\"f_carrier_bot\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> and activate its <hl>transport route</> button <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>.": "建造 <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> 後，選中 <img id=\"f_carrier_bot\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> 並啟用其 <hl>運輸路線</> 按鈕 <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>。",
	"Build storage and turn on a runner's transport route": "建造倉庫並開啟運輸機器人的運輸路線",
	"Set the <hl>Goto</> register <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_goto.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/> of the runner to the unit mining silica to pick up from it.": "將運輸機器人的<hl>前往</>暫存器<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_goto.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/>指向開採矽砂的裝置，使其進行拾取。",
	"Set the <hl>Unit Mining Silica</> as the <hl>Goto</> point": "將<hl>開採矽砂的裝置</>設為<hl>前往</>目標點",
	"Set up Transport Route 3": "設置運輸路線3",
	"Set the <hl>Store</> register <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/> to the <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to drop off its items.": "將<hl>商店</>的暫存器<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/>設置為<img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，以卸下其物品。",
	"Set the <hl>Storage Unit</> as the <hl>Store</> location": "將<hl>儲存裝置</>設為<hl>儲存</>位置。",
	"Congratulations": "恭喜",
	"Now that you have learnt the basics of base building you are ready to continue with your mission to <hl>repair the Mothership</>.\n\nThe tutorial begins in <hl>passive mode</> meaning the native population of bugs will not come out of their <img id=\"f_bug_hive\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> or <img id=\"f_bug_hole\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> until you attack them.": "現在你已經掌握了基地建設的基礎知識，可以繼續執行<hl>修復母艦</>的任務了。\n\n教學以<hl>被動模式</>開始，這意味著蟲族原住民不會主動離開他們的<img id=\"f_bug_hive\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>或<img id=\"f_bug_hole\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，除非你主動攻擊他們。",
	"<hl>Behaviors</> are an advanced mechanic for controlling units. To get started, add an <hl>Integrated Behavior</> to a unit via the <hl>unit options</> menu.\n\nMore information and story dialogue can be found in the <hl>Codex</> (<Key action=\"Codex\" style=\"hl\"/>).": "<hl>行為指令</>是控制單位的高級機制。初始操作需通過<hl>單位選項</>菜單為單位添加<hl>集成行為</>。\n\n更多資訊及劇情對話詳見<hl>手冊</>（<Key action=\"Codex\" style=\"hl\"/>）。",
	"Continuation": "繼續",
	"You can choose to continue to play this game or start a <hl>new game</> and customize many of the gameplay settings for your playstyle.\n\nGood luck, <hl>Commander</>!": "你可以選擇繼續遊玩當前遊戲，或開始<hl>新遊戲</>並根據個人風格自訂多種遊戲設置。\n\n祝你好運，<hl>指揮官</>！",

