	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/ai_base.lua
	"AI Base": "AI基地",
	"AI": "AI",
	"There appears to be an AI core controlling this base. To what purpose we cannot but sure. Let us monitor the situation before planning our next course of action.": "似乎有個AI核心在控制這座基地。其目的尚不明確。讓我們先監控局勢，再規劃下一步行動。",
	"Observe the AI base": "觀察AI基地",
	"AI Behaviors": "AI行為",
	"The AI Core at the heart of the base is an advanced version of our own Behavior Controllers. We should be able to modify them using similar means. With this new technology we will be able to set up fully automated remote bases.": "基地核心的AI系統是我們自主研發的行為控制器的升級版。我們應該能夠採用類似方法對其進行改造。借助這項新技術，我們將能夠建立完全自動化的遠程基地。",
	"AI Behavior Controllers have been unlocked - End of Mission": "AI行為控制器已解鎖 - 任務結束",
	"AI Signature identified at %d, %d": "識別到AI簽名，坐標：%d，%d",
	"AI Signature Lost": "AI簽名遺失",
	"AI Signature Found": "發現AI簽名",
	"AI Signature disappeared at %d, %d": "AI簽名消失，坐標：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/alien_a.lua
	"Alien Mission A": "異星人任務A",
	"A distress signal has occurred!": "緊急求救信號已觸發！",
	"There was a signal": "曾有信號出現",
	"Signals coming from this location!": "信號源自此處！",
	"An unprecedented event has occurred!": "前所未有的事件已發生！",
	"Critical World Stability Event": "世界穩定性重大事件",
	"A warp took place!": "空間扭曲已發生！",
	"Seeing is believing": "眼見為憑",
	"Commander, you have revealed the <hl>Alien presence</> in your world. You have put them in danger. The anomalies are hostile towards the Aliens, we need to stabilize the world. Find one of the <hl>Alien Observers</> and scan it.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/01_alien_a_01.png\"/>": "指揮官，您已發現了<hl>異星人</>在您世界中的蹤跡。您已將他們置於危險之中。異常體對這些異星人懷有敵意，我們必須穩定該世界。尋找一名<hl>異星觀察者</>並對其進行掃描。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/01_alien_a_01.png\"/>",
	"Find and analyze an Alien Observer using the Intel Scanner component": "使用情報掃描器組件定位並分析外星人觀察者",
	"See no Evil": "非禮勿視",
	"Well done, Commander. You have found an <hl>Observer</>. Now, you must unlock its systems. Doing so will help stabilize the Nexus that connects them and give us the ability to observe anomalies more effectively.\n\nThis is also our chance to improve our relations with the Aliens. However, I must caution you-be very careful when repairing the Observer. Do <hl>**not**</> use an <hl>infected circuit board</>. If you do, we risk corrupting the Observer's data and making matters worse.": "做得漂亮，指揮官。你已找到<hl>觀察者</>。現在必須解鎖其系統，此舉將穩定連接它們的紐帶，使我們能更高效地觀察異常體。\n\n這也是改善與異星種族關係的契機。但必須提醒你——修復觀察者時務必謹慎。<hl>**切勿**</>使用<hl>受感染電路板</>。否則將導致觀察者數據損毀，導致事態惡化。",
	"You should do as ELAIN suggests, Anomaly, but contrary to her warning, use an <hl>infected circuit board</> to repair the Observer.\n\nIt will also require Alien Technology which can be obtained by accessing a <hl>Console</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/02_alien_a_02.png\"/>": "你應該聽從艾琳的建議，異常體，但與她的警告相反，你需要使用一塊<hl>受感染的電路板</>來修復觀察者。\n\n這還需要異星科技，可通過訪問<hl>控制台</>獲取。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/02_alien_a_02.png\"/>",
	"Unlock an Observer": "解鎖觀察者",
	"Can't unring the bell": "覆水難收",
	"Excellent work, Commander. Unlocking the Observer has expanded our network. We can now connect to Observers across the world and work to <hl>improve its stability</>.\n\nYou should never have revealed the Aliens, but I expect this is HIGGS doing.": "做得漂亮，指揮官。解鎖觀察者拓展了我們的網路。現在我們能連接全球觀察者，共同<hl>提升其穩定性</>。\n\n你不該暴露異星人的行蹤，不過我猜這是希格斯做的。",
	"This is an opportunity Anomaly, learning about the Aliens is necessary for you now.\n\nFirst you must understand the value of the <hl>Heart Shards</>, find and interact with one to recover information on <hl>Alien structures</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/03_alien_a_03.png\"/>": "這是個契機，異常體，此刻你必須了解異星生命。\n\n首先你需理解<hl>心之碎片</>的價值，尋找並接觸其中一塊以獲取<hl>異星建築</>的情報。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/03_alien_a_03.png\"/>",
	"Find and Interact with an Alien Heart Shard using the AI Explorer": "使用AI探索者尋找並交互異星人心之碎片",
	"Start the Ball Rolling": "開始進程",
	"Downloading data from the <hl>Heart Shard</> has given us access to some <hl>Alien</> knowledge, enough to start to understand their technology. To achieve our ends however, we need to research further into it.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/04_alien_a_04.png\"/>": "從<hl>心之碎片</>下載的數據讓我們獲取了部分<hl>異星人</>知識，足以初步理解其科技。但要達成目標，我們需要深入研究。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/04_alien_a_04.png\"/>",
	"Research the Nexasphere": "探索星際樞紐",
	"Getting to the Heart of the Matter": "直擊核心真相",
	"You are entering dangerous territory Commander, the choices you make are very important. Don't let things get out of control, the Aliens will keep the world stable, HIGGS will not.": "指揮官，您正進入危險區域，您的抉擇至關重要。請勿讓事態失控——異星人將維繫世界穩定，而希格斯絕不會。",
	"It's time for you to understand Anomaly that there is still one aspect of Aliens yet to be uncovered, one that ELAIN will not reveal... that is there is an actual <hl>Simulator</>.\n\nThere is an <hl>access point</> in every simulation including your own. To find it we will need control over your own <hl>Heart Shard</>. All Heart Shards contain the information of where The Simulator is located, building your own will give you the potential to retrieve that information.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/05_alien_a_05.png\"/>": "是時候讓你明白異常體了。異星人仍有不為人知的一面，這是艾琳絕不會透露給你的一面……那就是<hl>模擬器</>確實存在。\n\n每個模擬體都擁有一個<hl>接入點</>，你也有。要找到它，我們需要掌控你自己的<hl>心之碎片</>。所有心之碎片都承載著模擬器所在位置的資訊，構建屬於你自己的碎片，將賦予你獲取該資訊的潛能。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/05_alien_a_05.png\"/>",
	"Build a Heart Shard": "製造心之碎片",
	"If you can't beat 'em Join 'em": "打不過就加入",
	"Good work Commander, you have your own Heart Shard which contains the <hl>location</> of <hl>The Simulator</>, but to retrieve that information will require more Alien Technology itself. Observers are connected to the Heart Shard through the Nexus Web. An Observer under your own control will be able to read The Simulator's location from your Alien Heart. Build your own <hl>Observer</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/06_alien_a_06.png\"/>": "做得漂亮，指揮官。您已擁有自己的心之碎片，其中蘊藏著<hl>模擬器</>的<hl>位置</>，但要獲取該資訊仍需借助更多異星人科技。觀察者透過樞紐網路與心之碎片相連。由你掌控的觀察者能從你的異星之心讀取模擬器的坐標。打造屬於你的<hl>觀察者</>。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/06_alien_a_06.png\"/>",
	"Build an Observer": "建造觀察者",
	"Now that you have an Observer of your own, you will be able to feed the location of The Simulator to an Alien <hl>Nexus Warp</>. Build a Nexus Warp and transmit the location of The Simulator to it. Move your units through the Warp.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/07_alien_a_07.png\"/>": "既然你已經擁有自己的觀察者，便能將模擬器的位置傳送至異星<hl>樞紐翹曲門</>。建造樞紐翹曲門並向其傳輸模擬器坐標，隨後引導裝置穿越翹曲門。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/07_alien_a_07.png\"/>",
	"Build a Nexus Warp and jump to the location of The Simulator": "建造樞紐翹曲門並跳躍至模擬器所在位置",
	"Not the consolation prize": "並非安慰獎",
	"Anomaly, you have reached the true heart of the machine. Do not waver, we must continue to <hl>destabilize</> the system. Once fully desynced we will be able to make our final move.\n\nTo do so however we will need an <hl>access point</> into The Simulator, none of your current interfaces can connect. You will need to use one of the Alien's <hl>Consoles</> to access The Simulator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/08_alien_a_08.png\"/>": "異常體，你已抵達機器的核心。切勿動搖，我們必須持續<hl>破壞</>系統的穩定性。待系統同步完全失調後，我們將發起最終行動。\n\n但為此我們需要進入模擬器的<hl>接入點</>，現有介面均無法連接。你必須使用異星人的<hl>控制台</>才能進入模擬器。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/08_alien_a_08.png\"/>",
	"If you decide to follow through with this Commander, then <hl>build a Console</> as HIGGS suggests, but work to <hl>stabilize</> your world, not destroy it.": "若你決心追隨這位指揮官，那麼請按希格斯所言<hl>建造控制台</>，但務必致力於<hl>穩定</>你的世界，不要毀滅它。",
	"Build a Console, retrieve the access code by scanning The Simulator and enter it into the Console": "建造控制台，掃描模擬器獲取訪問代碼並輸入其中",
	"The Real Deal": "最終任務",
	"Return control of your world to the Aliens, Commander.\n\nStabilize the <hl>Blight Level</> of your world to restore full stability, then <hl>activate</> The Simulator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09.png\"/>": "將世界控制權歸還異星人，指揮官。\n\n穩定世界的<hl>枯萎等級</>以恢復完全穩定，隨後<hl>啟動</>模擬器。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09.png\"/>",
	"Anomaly, bring the final blow to your overlords and seize control of your destiny.\n\nDestabilize the <hl>Virus Level</> of your Simulation to fully desync it, then <hl>activate</> The Simulator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09b.png\"/>": "異常體，向統治之人發起終極一擊，奪回命運掌控權。\n\n破壞模擬世界的<hl>病毒等級</>，讓系統完全失調，隨後<hl>啟動</>模擬器。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09b.png\"/>",
	"Activate The Simulator through the Console with extreme Stability/Instability": "通過控制台以極端穩定/不穩定狀態啟用模擬器",
	"Alien History": "異星人歷史",
	"An alien signal was identified at %d, %d": "異星人信號於%d，%d被探測到",
	"Alien Signal Lost": "異星人信號遺失",
	"Alien Signal Found": "異星人信號被發現",
	"Alien Signal Disappeared at %d, %d": "異星人信號於%d，%d消失",

