	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/blight_a.lua
	"Blight Peekaboo": "枯萎追蹤",
	"hostile": "敵對",
	"It got away...": "它逃走了……",
	"There was something in the blight but it disappeared. It vanished as we approached. The electrical field in the blight has been disrupting our equipment making it difficult to enter. What could possibly move so quickly and freely within such a place?": "枯萎區域中似乎有什麼東西。但當我們靠近時，它就消失了。這裡的電場一直在干擾我們的設備，導致我們很難進入裡面。究竟是什麼東西能在這種地方以如此之快的速度自由移動呢？",
	"Let's hope we see it again.": "希望我們能再次看到。",
	"It got away again...": "它又逃走了……",
	"Again, it vanished into the mist as we got near. Yet it was certainly a dark form that bore some similarity to the bizarre rock formations we have been seeing around the blight. We need to uncover the secrets of the blight and these forms that can move within it.": "我們一靠近，它就消失在了迷霧中。可以肯定的是，它是一種黑暗形態的存在，與這附近隨處可見的奇怪岩層頗為相似。我們必須解開這片枯萎區域的秘密，搞清楚這群在此隨意穿梭之物的底細。",
	"Perhaps we will see it once again...": "或許我們還能看見那東西吧……",
	"It vanished but this time it left us something...": "這次雖然消失了，但似乎給我們留下了什麼……",
	"It's gone again, disappeared in a flash. What has the ability to just de-materialize like that? It was certainly made of the same obsidian we see within the blight. It also glowed with energy similar to but unlike the blight, although maybe akin to it. Additional readings indicate it has left something behind.": "它又咻的一下消失了，究竟是什麼東西能夠這樣來無影去無蹤呢？它肯定是由我們在這片枯萎區域中所見到的黑曜石構成的，散發著與枯萎相似卻又不同的能量，或許與之有所關聯。讀數顯示，它留下了什麼東西。",
	"End of Mission! We couldn't seem to approach or catch it, the mystery remains unsolved. However, before it vanished it left us a parting gift!": "任務結束！我們似乎根本無法靠近或抓住它，謎題依然沒有解開。但那東西在離開之前，給我們留了一份禮物！",
	"A shadow in the mist!": "迷霧中的陰影！",
	"Unknown Signal Detected at %d, %d": "檢測到未知信號，坐標：%d，%d",
	"Unknown Signal Lost": "未知信號遺失",
	"Disturbance Detected": "檢測到干擾",
	"Unknown Signal Disappeared at %d, %d": "未知信號消失，坐標：%d，%d",

