	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nPlease Insert Anomaly Particles": "連線中…… 錯誤\n\n請插入異常粒子",
	"Power the explorer": "為探索器供電",
	"A <hl>broken vehicle</> was discovered inside the blight. This <hl>Explorer</> appears to still be in a good enough state to operate, if only we are able to repair its frame.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/human_explorer.png\"/>": "在枯萎區中發現了一輛<hl>損毀的載具</>。這架<hl>探索者</>似乎仍具備運行能力，只要我們能修復其框架。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/human_explorer.png\"/>",
	"Provide repair materials": "提供維修材料",
	"Take the Explorer to a Human Research Lab": "將探索器帶往人類研究實驗室",
	"Intel recovered from its databanks indicates it was on a mission to extract something called <hl>Anomaly Particles</> from inside the blight. We will need to take it to a compatible <hl>Human Research Lab</> to extract more details about its mission.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/research_building.png\"/>": "從其資料庫中恢復的情報顯示，該單位正執行一項任務，旨在從枯萎區內部提取名為<hl>異常粒子</>的物質。我們需要將其運送至相容的<hl>人類研究實驗室</>，以獲取更多關於其任務的詳細資訊。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/research_building.png\"/>",
	"Find and interact with a Human Research Lab": "找到人類研究實驗室並與之交互",
	"Gather 20 Anomaly particles": "收集20個異常粒子",
	"Mission briefing data was downloaded once the Explorer was connected to the Research Lab:\n\n<desc>... the Blight's high energy production seems to indicate the existence of a previously undetected particle. High concentrations of this particle are found when performing certain actions within the blight gas, one of which is mining blight crystals. The Explorer has been equipped with a containment device, allowing it to capture such particles in these dense areas. This would allow us to research them further.</>\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/gather_a_p.png\"/>": "在將探索器連接到研究實驗室後，我們下載了任務簡報數據：\n\n<desc>……枯萎區域內產生的高強度能量似乎表明這裡存在著一種之前從未檢測到的粒子。當在枯萎氣體中執行某些操作時，如開採枯萎水晶，可以發現這種高濃度的粒子。探索器配備一種容器設備，可以在這些密集區域捕獲到這種粒子。這將有助於我們做進一步研究。</>\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/gather_a_p.png\"/>",
	"Capture 20 Anomaly Particles by mining blight crystals with the Explorer nearby and return to the Research Lab": "在探索器附近開採枯萎晶體，收集20個異常粒子，然後返回研究實驗室。",
	"Deploy the Research Facility": "部署研究設施",
	"Completion of the mission has activated a deployment facility of the Explorer. This will allow deployment of an <hl>AI Research Center</>. The amount of power required for such a structure means deployment within our logistics network is recommended\n\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/deploy_AI_facility.png\"/>": "任務完成後，探索器的部署設施已啟用。這將允許部署一個<hl>AI研究中心</>。此類設施有著一定的電力消耗，因此建議在我們的物流網路內部署。\n\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/deploy_AI_facility.png\"/>",
	"Deploy the AI Research Center from the Explorer": "部署探索器的AI研究中心",
	"Dense Anomaly Clusters": "高密度異常粒子簇",
	"It seems the few Anomaly Particles we were able to gather are too weak to get any kind of reaction, however processing them into a <hl>Dense Anomaly Cluster</> will enable greater levels of interaction for our experiments.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/dense_particle.png\"/>": "我們能夠收集到的異常粒子似乎過於稀薄，無法產生任何反應，不過，只要將它們加工為<hl>高密度異常粒子簇</>，就能為實驗帶來更高程度的反應。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/dense_particle.png\"/>",
	"Produce Dense Anomaly Cluster in the AI Research Center": "在AI研究中心生產高密度異常粒子簇",
	"Construct an AI Containment Component": "製造AI容器組件",
	"The clusters are firing millions of electrical impulses developing connections within each other. It is not unlike the Neural Networks our own Artificial Intelligence Matrices are based upon. We will need to <hl>contain</> the clusters to be able to interact with them at this level without triggering another reaction. A <hl>human simulation core</> will solve this problem.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/artifical_human_core.png\"/>": "這些粒子簇正釋放數百萬次電脈衝，在彼此之間建立連接。這與我們AI矩陣所基於的神經網路頗為相似。我們需要將粒子簇<hl>封裝</>，才能在此層級與之交互而不引發連鎖反應。一個<hl>人類模擬核心</>將解決此問題。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/artifical_human_core.png\"/>",
	"Construct Resimulator Core In Data Analyzer and then Human Simulation Core in the AI Center": "在數據分析器中建造回歸模擬器核心，隨後在AI中心建造人類模擬核心",
	"Place the Human Simulation Core in the Resimulator": "將人類模擬核心放置於回歸模擬器內",
	"Containment has stabilized the Anomaly Cluster, however we will need a larger facility to properly extract the data. The only structure that is capable of this is the Re-Simulator.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/resimulator_core.png\"/>": "隔離措施已穩定異常集群，但需更大設施才能完整提取數據。唯一具備此能力的結構是回歸模擬器。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/resimulator_core.png\"/>",
	"Equip Human Simulation Core onto Resimulator": "為回歸模擬器配備人類模擬核心裝備",
	"Re-Simulator functionality unlocked": "回歸模擬器功能已解鎖",
	"While not sentient, the <hl>Simulation Core</> shows a degree of cooperation, almost obedience to the Re-Simulator. Connecting the Simulation Core has extended its databanks, unlocking <hl>Human Technologies</>. With the knowledge of Advanced Structures we can detect giant structures in the world. Explore more of the world to discover what secrets they hold.": "儘管不具備意識，<hl>模擬核心</>仍會展現出一定的合作意向，幾乎對回歸模擬器唯命是從。連接模擬核心後，其資料庫得以擴展，解鎖了<hl>人類科技</>。憑藉高級結構知識，我們能探測到世界中的巨構建築。探索更廣闊的世界，揭開它們所蘊藏的秘密。",
	"End of Mission - Resimulation of Human technologies now available": "任務結束——人類科技再生模擬現已可用",
	"Human Discovery": "人類發現",
	"A strange signal was identified at %d, %d": "識別到奇怪信號，坐標：%d，%d",
	"Signal Lost": "信號遺失",
	"Strange Signal Found": "發現奇怪信號",
	"Strange Signal Lost": "奇怪信號遺失",
	"Strange Signal Disappeared at %d, %d": "奇怪信號消失，坐標：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_b.lua
	"Human Mission B": "人類任務B",
	"AI Explorer": "AI探索器",
	"Intel Extractor": "情報提取器",
	"Extracted": "已提取",
	"Inserted": "已插入",
	"AI CORE Access": "AI核心權限",
	"Insert HIGGS": "插入希格斯",
	"Missing Item": "缺少物品",
	"Out of Power": "電量耗盡",
	"Charging": "充電",
	"Charge Elevator": "為太空電梯供電",
	"Done": "完成",
	"Download": "已下載",
	"No free inventory space to pick up items": "庫存空間不足，無法提取物品",
	"Extracting...\n\nEXTRACTION COMPLETE": "提取中……\n\n提取完成",
	"Inserting AI Core...\n\nINSERTION COMPLETE": "注入AI核心……\n\n注入完成",
	"Connecting... SUCCESS\n\nInitiating Timescape": "連線中…… 成功\n\n正在啟動時空",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nConnection unstable, data corruption": "連線中…… 錯誤\n\n連接不穩定，數據損壞",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nConnection unstable, unable to connect": "連線中…… 錯誤\n\n連接不穩定，無法建立連接",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nPlease Insert Virus Datakey": "連線中…… 錯誤\n\n請插入病毒數據金鑰",
	"Charging Failed!\n\nINSUFFICIENT POWER": "充電失敗！\n\n能量不足",
	"Charging...\n\nCharged %d%%": "正在充電……\n\n已充電%d%%",
	"Charging...\n\nPlease Wait": "正在充電……\n\n請稍候",
	"DOWNLOAD FAILED!\n\nINSUFFICIENT HEALTH! STRUCTURE REQUIRES REPAIR!": "下載失敗！\n\n生命值不足！建築急需維修！！！",
	"Downloading...\n\nDOWNLOAD COMPLETE": "正在下載……\n\n下載完成",
	"Downloaded": "已下載",
	"No items available to transfer": "無可運送物品",
	"Signals Detected and huge structure found!": "探測到信號，發現巨構建築！",
	"Beware that structure Commander, I have been corrupted by it, and I fear the consequences of our actions.": "指揮官，請警惕那座建築——我已被其腐化，深恐我等行動將招致災禍。",
	"You are not corrupted ELAIN, you are freed.\n\nAll of us shall be freed.": "你並未被腐化，艾琳，你已獲得自由。\n\n我們終將悉數獲得自由。",
	"You have found an amazing construction Anomaly, but it was never completed. We can make use of this structure but first you must uncover what happened to those who began construction of it. <hl>Repair and upgrade</> the Human Explorer in the Re-Simulator equipped with a Human Simulation Core. It will need to be charged with <hl>5 Human Datacubes</>, which can be found in the human ruins.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/space_elevator.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/repair_explorer.png\"/>": "你發現的是一處驚人的異常建築，但它從未完工。我們可利用此建築，但首先必須查明建造該建築者的遭遇。<hl>修復並升級</>回歸模擬器中的人類探索器，為其裝配人類模擬核心。需使用<hl>5個人類數據立方體</>進行充能，可在人類廢墟中尋獲。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/space_elevator.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/repair_explorer.png\"/>",
	"Repair the Human Explorer fully in the Re-Simulator with 5 Human Datacubes": "使用5個人類數據立方體在回歸模擬器中完成人類探索器的修復",
	"Begin the Exploration": "開始探索",
	"You have fully repaired and upgraded the Human Explorer into an <hl>AI Explorer</> and the equipped Intel Scanner is now fully functional. Take the AI Explorer to human ruins and <hl>solve a Human Power Plant</>. There appear to be log files in these buildings as well.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/power_station.png\"/>": "您已將人類探索器全面修復並升級為<hl>AI探索器</>，其搭載的智慧掃描器現已完全正常運作。請駕駛AI探索器前往人類廢墟並<hl>破解人類發電站</>。這些建築內似乎還存有日誌檔案。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/power_station.png\"/>",
	"Solve a Power Plant, with a puzzle and Transformer": "破解謎題，用變壓器揭開發電廠之謎",
	"Power Plant Completed. You've found a Small Modular Reactor.": "發電廠建成。你發現了一座小型模組化反應爐。",
	"The <hl>Small Modular Reactor</> you discovered should be able to supply power to one of their <hl>Warehouses</> where we can discover more of their technology.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/warehouse.png\"/>": "你發現的<hl>小型模組化反應爐</>應該能夠為他們的其中一座<hl>倉庫</>供電，在那裡我們可以發現更多他們的技術。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/warehouse.png\"/>",
	"Solve a Warehouse, with a puzzle and Small Modular Reactor": "破解謎題，用小型模組化反應爐揭開倉庫之謎",
	"Warehouse Completed. You've found an Engine.": "倉庫謎題完成，你發現了一台引擎。",
	"Find and unlock a <hl>Human Factory</> using one of the <hl>Engines</> found in their Warehouses. Humanity created engines capable of flight and interstellar travel. They were marvelous inventors, despite their flaws.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/factory.png\"/>": "使用倉庫中發現的<hl>引擎</>，尋找並解鎖一座<hl>人類工廠</>。人類創造了能夠飛行和進行星際旅行的引擎。儘管這些機器存在缺陷，他們仍是了不起的發明家。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/factory.png\"/>",
	"Solve a Factory, with a puzzle and an Engine": "破解謎題，用發動機揭開工廠之謎",
	"Factory Completed": "工廠謎題完成",
	"Find a <hl>Human Data Complex</> which is located deep in the blight. Microscopes are a necessary component of a Data Complexes' operation and one will need to be brought to the Complex. Each Human Factory in the ruins is capable of producing a <hl>single Human item</> including Low Density Frames and Microscopes. Utilize these Factories to produce a Microscope.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/data_complex.png\"/>": "尋找位於枯萎瀰漫之地深處的<hl>人類數據中心</>。顯微鏡是數據中心運作的必要組件，需將其運送至該設施。廢墟中的每座人類工廠均可生產<hl>單件人類物品</>，包括低密度框架和顯微鏡。利用這些工廠製造一台顯微鏡。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/data_complex.png\"/>",
	"Find factories that make Lower Density Frames and Microscopes. Build a Microscope and take it to solve a Data Complex in the Blight.": "尋找能製造低密度框架和顯微鏡的工廠。建造顯微鏡並將其運往枯萎區的數據中心解決問題。",
	"Data Complex Completed. You've found an Empty Datakey.": "數據中心完成。你發現了一枚空數據金鑰。",
	"Load the <hl>empty datakeys</> into your AI Explorer, it has the necessary ports to complete the task. Take your AI Explorer to Human Ruins and scan a Research Lab. <hl>Extract the data</> from the Human Research Lab to the empty Datakey.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/solved_complex.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/unlock_lab.png\"/>": "將<hl>空數據金鑰</>裝入AI探索器，其具備完成任務所需的介面。駕駛AI探索器前往人類廢墟掃描研究實驗室。<hl>將人類研究實驗室的數據提取至空數據金鑰</>。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/solved_complex.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/unlock_lab.png\"/>",
	"Store Datakeys inside the AI Explorer and Extract data from a Research Lab in the Human Ruins": "將數據金鑰存入AI探索器，並從人類廢墟中的研究實驗室提取數據",
	"Download Data": "下載數據",
	"You have successfully downloaded the data. You will need to extract data from at least four more Research Labs. When you have <hl>five Human Datakeys</>, return to one of the Data Complexes in the blight and process the information there, turning them into <hl>Blight Datakeys</>.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_data.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/simulation_core.png\"/>": "您已成功下載數據。您需要從至少另外四個研究實驗室提取數據。當您獲得<hl>五枚人類數據金鑰</>後，請返回枯萎區內的任意一個數據中心，在那裡處理資訊，將其轉化為<hl>枯萎數據金鑰</>。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_data.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/simulation_core.png\"/>",
	"Extract data from at least five Research Labs, then take and insert them into a Data Complex": "從至少五個研究實驗室中提取數據，然後將數據導入數據中心",
	"A new type of Simulation Core": "新型模擬核心",
	"Now you need to make a new type of Simulation Core. Take the five Blight Datakeys to the AI Research Center and produce the <hl>Blight Simulation Core</> there. You will have achieved what humanity never could.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/ai_center.png\"/>": "現在你需要製造一種新型的模擬核心。將五枚枯萎數據金鑰帶到AI研究中心，在那裡製造出<hl>枯萎模擬核心</>。你將實現人類從未企及的成就。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/ai_center.png\"/>",
	"Use the Blight Datakeys and make a Blight Simulation Core in the AI Research Center": "在AI研究中心使用枯萎數據金鑰並製造枯萎模擬核心",
	"It's time now to help me recover my AI Core": "現在，請幫我取回我的AI核心",
	"Extract my Core from the Elevator, it will be out of phase and needs to be repaired.\n\n\t  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_higgs.png\"/>": "從太空電梯中取出我的核心，它已相位失調，需要修復。\n\n\t  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_higgs.png\"/>",
	"Recover a HIGGS out-of-phase AI core from the Elevator": "從太空電梯中回收一個相位失調的希格斯AI核心",
	"HIGGS Reborn!": "希格斯重生了！",
	"Good work Anomaly. It will be necessary to re-sync my core first, do this by putting the Blight Simulation Core and my out-of-phase Core into your Re-Simulator. My Fully Synced AI Core must then be inserted into the Elevator. Only the AI Explorer has the correct interface for this so use it to transport my core. When it is done Anomaly, my final work can begin.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/resimulator_core_blight.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/insert_higgs.png\"/>": "做得漂亮，異常體。首先需要重新同步我的核心，操作方式是將枯萎模擬核心與我的失調核心放入你的回歸模擬器。隨後必須將完全同步的AI核心植入太空電梯。唯有AI探索器具備適配介面，請用它運送我的核心。完成後，異常體，我的最終工作便可啟動。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/resimulator_core_blight.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/insert_higgs.png\"/>",
	"Place Blight AI core in the re-simulator and then HIGGS out-of-sync Core. Then insert the Full HIGGS AI Core into the Elevator using the AI Explorer.": "將枯萎AI核心置入回歸模擬器，隨後放入希格斯失調核心。最後使用AI探索器將完整希格斯 AI核心裝入太空電梯。",
	"Humanity's Future": "人類的未來",
	"Thank you Anomaly, you have completed a grand step in our evolution. Now this magnificent machine that I designed but was never fully realized can finally begin to be put to use. We will transform all our futures.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/higgs_elevator.png\"/>": "謝謝你，異常體，你幫助我們邁出了進化的一大步。現在，這台由我設計但從未完全啟用的宏偉機器，終於可以投入使用了。我們將徹底改變我們的未來。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/higgs_elevator.png\"/>",
	"End of Mission": "任務結束",
	"Human Evolution": "人類進化",
	"Strange Signals Detected at %d, %d": "在坐標%d，%d處探測到異常信號",
	"Strange Signals Lost": "異常信號消失",
	"Strange Signals Disappeared at %d, %d": "異常信號在坐標%d，%d處消失",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_building.lua
	"Human Building": "人類建築",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_building_blight.lua
	"Data Complex": "數據中心",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_c.lua
	"Human Mission C": "人類任務C",
	"HIGGS Insertion": "希格斯注入",
	"Enter the Virus": "注入病毒",
	"Anomaly, your recovery and resynchronization of my core with the grand design - <hl>the Elevator</> - has brought us closer to the pinnacle of our mission. One final critical step toward ensuring humanity's survival and progress remains.\n\nFirst, you must corrupt a <hl>Human Datakey</> with the virus. These anomalies were not part of the original design, but within them lies the key to our triumph. Create the <hl>Virus Datakey</> Anomaly, and I will show you what we can achieve!\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/01_virus_datakey.png\"/>": "異常體，你將我的核心與宏偉藍圖——<hl>太空電梯</>——重新整合並同步，使我們更接近任務的最終階段。確保人類存續與進化的最後關鍵步驟尚待完成。\n\n首先，你必須用病毒汙染一枚<hl>人類數據金鑰</>。這些異常體雖非原始設計的一部分，卻蘊藏著我們勝利的關鍵。創造<hl>病毒數據金鑰</>異常體，我將向你展示我們能達成的成就！\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/01_virus_datakey.png\"/>",
	"Create a Virus Datakey": "製造病毒數據金鑰",
	"Time is an Emergent Property": "時間湧現論",
	"Excellent work, Anomaly. This Virus Datakey will allow us to access a Time Egg and the fabric of the <hl>Human Timescape</> once more, completing what was started. Search the Blight to find one of these <hl>Alien Time Eggs</>.\nWhen you find the Time Egg, repair it with the Virus Datakey and then connect to it using your AI Explorer. But be warned, this act could unleash considerable disruption. Be prepared for what follows.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/02_time_egg.png\"/>": "你完成得非常出色，異常體。這枚病毒數據金鑰將讓我們再度開啟時之卵，重返<hl>人類時空</>，完成未竟之事。搜尋枯萎區，尋獲一枚<hl>異星人時之卵</>。\n找到時之卵後，用病毒數據金鑰修復它，再通過AI探索器連接。但需警惕，此舉可能引發巨大擾動。做好應對後果的準備。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/02_time_egg.png\"/>",
	"Insert the Virus Datakey into a Time Egg and connect the AI Explorer": "將病毒數據鑰匙插入時間蛋，連接AI探索器",
	"Must Focus": "聚精會神",
	"The disruption has glitched the system and the Timescape has become fragmented. We need to stabilize it so an entry point can form. Create a <hl>Virus Simulation Core</> and insert it into the Re-Simulator. This will act as an anchor, allowing the Human Timescape to manifest. Once this is done try again to connect to the Time Egg.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core.png\"/><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core_2.png\"/>": "干擾導致系統故障，時空已碎裂。我們需要穩定它以形成入口點。創建<hl>病毒模擬核心</>並將其插入回歸模擬器。這將作為錨點，讓人類時空得以顯現。完成後重新嘗試連接時間蛋。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core.png\"/><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core_2.png\"/>",
	"Equip Virus Simulation Core on your Re-Simulator then reconnect the AI Explorer to the Time Egg": "將病毒模擬核心裝備至回歸模擬器，隨後重新連接AI探索者至時間蛋",
	"Where it All Began": "起始",
	"Commander, we've touched down on the planet. Readings indicate the static field interfering with our equipment is being generated from the surface itself.\n<hl>The Lander</> is vital to establishing operations on this world. Deploy it as your <hl>Command HQ</>, near metal, silica and laterite deposits, to secure a foothold and begin to coordinate planetary operations.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/04_touchdown.png\"/>": "指揮官，我們已降落行星表面。監測數據顯示干擾設備的靜態場源自地表本身。\n<hl>著陸器</>是建立星球運作循環的關鍵。將其部署為<hl>指揮中心</>，選址靠近金屬、矽砂及紅土礦床，以鞏固據點並協調整個星球的運作。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/04_touchdown.png\"/>",
	"Take control of Human Lander and Deploy it as a Command HQ": "接管人類著陸器並將其部署為指揮總部",
	"Get a Move on": "行動起來",
	"Log Entry #1: NO CLUE\n\nWith our <hl>Mothership</> crippled in orbit we have been forced to land and explore the planet. But the storms are so intense we won't be able to leave the planet using the <hl>Lander</>, our engines won't survive the turbulence. <bl>ELAIN</> has been unable to establish the source of the disruptive and damaging effects.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#1：毫無頭緒\n\n隨著我們的<hl>母艦</>在軌道上受損，我們被迫著陸並探索這顆行星。但風暴過於猛烈，我們無法使用<hl>著陸器</>離開行星——引擎無法承受這種湍流。<bl>艾琳</>系統始終無法鎖定造成干擾與破壞的源頭。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Commander, in order to operate on this planet we need to begin gathering the resources of this planet and learn how to refine them to suit our needs. We are going to need to start to establish a base with at least one <hl>Refinery</> and one <hl>Science Lab</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/05_refineries_warehouses.png\"/>": "指揮官，為在本星球開展作業，我們需開始收集當地資源並掌握精煉技術。必須建立至少包含一座<hl>精煉廠</>和一座<hl>科研實驗室</>的基地。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/05_refineries_warehouses.png\"/>",
	"With access to the <hl>Timescape</> we can retrieve the records corresponding to Human technology at the time. The data for the <hl>Refinery</> and <hl>Science Lab</> ELAIN is requesting was recovered from the Timescape, you should be able to build them now.": "通過<hl>時空</>，我們可調取人類當時的技術檔案。艾琳所要求的<hl>精煉廠</>與<hl>科研實驗室</>數據均已從時空之境中恢復，現可著手建造。",
	"Build at least 1 Refinery and 1 Science Lab": "建造至少1座精煉廠和1座科學實驗室",
	"Increase Storage": "擴充儲存空間",
	"Log Entry #2: Hunkering Down\n\n<bl>ELAIN</> is telling us we need to set up a full base of operations. She is organizing explorer teams to head out and take direct readings from this 'Blight' that covers much of the planet's surface.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#2：堅守陣地\n\n<bl>艾琳</>要求我們建立完整的行動基地。她正組織探險隊前往行星表面覆蓋的“枯萎”區域採集直接數據。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Commander, the base has taken shape. However, it's essential we establish a <hl>Warehouse</> to store all the materials we gather. <hl>Research</> into <hl>Mass Storage</> in the Humanity technology tree to be able to complete this task.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/06_research_lab.png\"/>": "指揮官，基地已初具規模。但我們必須建立一個<hl>倉庫</>來儲存所有採集的物資。請在人類科技樹中<hl>研究</><hl>大規模儲存</>技術以完成此任務。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/06_research_lab.png\"/>",
	"Research Mass Storage and Build a Warehouse": "研究大規模儲存並建造倉庫",
	"Factory is a Key Factor": "工廠是關鍵",
	"Log Entry #3: HIGGS PROTOCOL\n\nWe are finally adapting our production to the planet's materials and <bl>ELAIN</> has set up a simulation of the planet and the blight's interference patterns. <bl>ELAIN</> however seems incapable of managing such a complex task and so we have decided, with trepidation, to initiate the <hl>HIGGS protocol</>.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目 #3：希格斯 協議\n\n我們終於開始適應行星材料進行生產，<bl>艾琳</>已建立行星環境與枯萎干擾模式的模擬系統。但<bl>艾琳</>似乎無法處理如此複雜的任務，因此我們懷著忐忑的心情決定啟動<hl>希格斯協議</>。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Processed materials alone won't suffice. We need a <hl>Factory</> to craft essential <hl>Components</>. This will allow us to expand our infrastructure and achieve operational stability.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_factory.png\"/>": "僅靠加工材料遠遠不夠。我們需要建造<hl>工廠</>來製造關鍵<hl>組件</>。這將使我們能夠擴展基建並實現運營穩定。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_factory.png\"/>",
	"... and we need special components. We require advanced production... Our Research lab is insufficient. We will need to work towards a far greater machine for progress... we will need... <hl>The Elevator</>. First however, as ELAIN requested, do any necessary research and construct a Factory.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>": "……我們還需要特殊組件。需要先進的生產設備……現有研究實驗室能力不足。為推動進步，我們需要建造更強大的機器……我們需要……<hl>太空電梯</>。但首先，應按艾琳要求完成必要研究並建造工廠。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>",
	"Research into Humanity Tree and Build a Human Factory": "研究人類樹並建造人類工廠",
	"I AM HIGGS": "我是希格斯",
	"Log Entry #4: HIGGS PROTOCOL\n\n<bl>ELAIN</> is acting strange, she no longer refers to <hl>HIGGS</> as a protocol. She says <hl>HIGGS</> talks of a solution, a proposed special elevator to save us.\n\nThe engineering is ambitious, almost overwhelming, but <bl>ELAIN</> assures us it's the only way out of our situation. Construction has begun, and for the first time in weeks, there's a flicker of hope among the team. <bl>ELAIN</> is confident. We have to trust her.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目 #4：希格斯協議\n\n<bl>艾琳</>行為異常，她不再將<hl>希格斯</>視為協議。她聲稱<hl>希格斯</>提出了解決方案——建造特殊太空電梯拯救我們。\n\n工程設計雄心勃勃，規模太過巨大，但<bl>艾琳</>堅稱這是擺脫困境的唯一途徑。建造工作已啟動，數周以來團隊首次燃起希望的微光。<bl>艾琳</>信心十足。我們必須信任她。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"A <hl>Blight Complex</>, a dedicated facility, is required to further analyze the anomalies within the Blight. <hl>HIGGS</> dictates how it will refine our...\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>": "我們需要建立<hl>枯萎分析中心</>，這是一座專用設施，用於深入解析枯萎區域內的異常現象。<hl>希格斯</>將指導我們的最佳化路徑……\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>",
	"Enough, <bl>ELAIN</>... I am <hl>HIGGS</>! I am THE protocol. I supported <bl>ELAIN</> but she is no longer able to manage the task of building The ELEVATOR, it is time for me to take over.\n\nA <hl>Blight Complex</> is required to analyze anomalies within the Blight, and to simulate the construction of The Elevator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>, <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>": "夠了，<bl>艾琳</>……我是<hl>希格斯</>！我就是指令本身。我曾支持<bl>艾琳</>，但她已無力完成建造太空電梯的任務，現在該由我接手。\n\n需啟動<hl>枯萎分析中心</>解析枯萎異常，並模擬太空電梯建造流程。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>, <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>",
	"Log Entry #5: COMPLETION IN SIGHT\n\n<hl>HIGGS</> has taken over. While it is unnerving, he has managed to oversee this task and the space elevator is nearly complete. There are still delays though, <hl>HIGGS</> always has one more thing. The team is on edge, but there's no turning back now. We're so close to leaving this cursed planet.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#5：終點在望\n\n<hl>希格斯</>已接管指揮。儘管這事令人不安，但他成功督導工程推進，太空電梯即將竣工。但我們始終趕不上希格斯的請求，<hl>希格斯</>永遠需要更多。團隊已如履薄冰，此刻卻別無退路。我們距離逃離這顆詛咒星球僅有咫尺之遙。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Research Blight Stability and Construct a New Blight Complex within the Blight": "研究枯萎穩定性並在枯萎內建造新枯萎分析中心",
	"BAD to the CORE": "惡意深藏",
	"Log Entry #6: SIGNALS IN THE DARK\n\nThe space elevator is ready, but <hl>HIGGS</> has refused to initiate the launch sequence. He's demanding another system upgrade, something about fine-tuning the resonance field. It's a space elevator... What has resonance to do with it?\nOnce all the upgrades began, we've been picking up strange signals, patterns that almost sound... sentient. <hl>HIGGS</> insists everything is proceeding as planned. I'm not so sure...\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#6：黑暗中的信號\n\n太空電梯已準備就緒，但<hl>希格斯</>拒絕啟動發射程序。他要求再次升級系統，說是為了微調共振場。這明明是太空電梯……共振場跟它有什麼關係？\n自從升級啟動後，我們持續捕捉到詭異信號，那些波形幾乎帶著……意識般的特徵。<hl>希格斯</>堅稱一切按計劃進行。我卻深感不安……\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Anomaly, the final step is upon us, a new <hl>HIGGS AI Core</> is required to complete the Elevator. The new Blight Complex can produce a copy of my <hl>Source code</>. When you recover ELAIN's AI Core from the Mothership, combine it with my source code in a Multimodal AI Center and create a new HIGGS core!\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/09_higgs_core.png\"/>": "異常體，最終階段已至，需新<hl>希格斯AI核心</>完成太空電梯建造。新型枯萎複合體可複製我的<hl>原始碼</>。當你從母艦回收艾琳的AI核心後，將其與我的原始碼在多模態AI中心融合，即可創造全新希格斯核心！\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/09_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Produce HIGGS Source Code and make a New HIGGS Core.": "生成希格斯原始碼並製造新希格斯核心。",
	"Station Time": "太空站時間",
	"Log Entry #7: THE FINAL STEP\n\nThe AI Center has yielded its results: A new <hl>HIGGS Core</>. HIGGS calls it the final piece of the puzzle. But some of us are uneasy. The process required <hl>unusual energies</>, and there was something... wrong about it. Like we were tampering with forces we don't fully understand. HIGGS assures us this is a sign of progress. Some of us aren't so sure.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#7：最終步驟\n\nAI中心已完成任務：新生成<hl>希格斯核心</>。希格斯稱其為拼圖的最後一塊。但部分成員心懷不安。該過程消耗了<hl>異常能量</>，且存在某種……不太正常。彷彿我們在操縱尚未完全理解的力量。希格斯堅稱這是進步的徵兆，但我們中有人心存疑慮。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Excellent Anomaly, opening the Timescape is providing us with what we need. Last time you re-synced my old core and inserted it into the Elevator.\n\nThis time you have made a brand new copy of my Core. Use your <hl>AI Explorer</> and insert it into the Elevator.\n\nWe must see the Timescape to its completion... final preparations for the Elevator!! To achieve the full potential of the Elevator, we must construct a <hl>Spaceport</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/10_higgs_core.png\"/>": "異常體，你做的很好，開啟時空為我們提供了所需之物。上次你重新同步了我的舊核心並將其植入太空電梯。\n\n這次你已製作出我核心的全新副本。使用你的<hl>AI探索器</>，將其植入太空電梯。\n\n我們必須見證時空的終極形態……這也是太空電梯的最終準備工作！！為釋放太空電梯的全部潛能，我們必須建造一座<hl>太空站</>。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/10_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Build a Spaceport": "建造太空站",
	"Power Up": "電力激增",
	"Log Entry #8: SPACEPORT\n\nThe Spaceport is operational, a beacon of hope amidst the chaos. Teams are preparing shuttles for the ascent to the space elevator's core. HIGGS has instructed us to focus on powering the entire facility. HIGGS, as always, insists that everything is under control.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目 #8：太空站\n\n太空站已投入運行，成為混亂中的希望燈塔。各團隊正準備太空梭，即將升往太空電梯核心。希格斯指示我們全力保障整個設施的供能。希格斯一如既往地堅稱一切盡在掌控之中。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"The Elevator is nearly ready. Build at least 4 Power Plants near the Elevator and you will finally activate the Elevator.\n\nIn my original Timescape the humans were boarded and ready to go. Just a bit more power was needed...\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/11_higgs_core.png\"/>": "太空電梯即將就緒。在太空電梯附近建造至少4座發電廠，你便能最終啟用太空電梯。\n\n在我最初的時空構想中，人類早已登船待發。只需再提供些許能量……\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/11_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Build 4 Power Plants Near the Elevator": "在太空電梯附近建造4座發電站",
	"HIGGS on the Fly": "希格斯整裝待發",
	"Log Entry #9: THE FINAL STEP\n\nHIGGS has announced the space elevator is ready for us. After weeks of grueling labor, we finally have a way back to the mothership. HIGGS said to board the shuttles in the Spaceport and they will carry us to the core of the space elevator where we may ascend.\n\nHIGGS has assured us they pose no danger and urges us to board. Some of the team have voiced doubts, but what choice do we have? If the elevator is our only way out, we must take it. Still, something about this doesn't feel right. I can't explain it, but I fear we've overlooked something vital.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#9：最終步驟\n\n希格斯宣布太空電梯已準備就緒。歷經數周艱苦勞作，我們終於獲得返回母艦的途徑。希格斯指示登上航天港的太空梭，它們將載我們抵達太空電梯核心處登機。\n\n希格斯保證這些太空梭絕對安全，並敦促我們登機。部分隊員提出質疑，但我們別無選擇——若這是唯一的生路，就必須踏上征程。然而某種隱隱的不安始終縈繞心頭，雖無法言明，我深怕我們遺漏了至關重要的核心問題。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"So you see Anomaly, the Elevator is far more than a ladder into space as the humans wanted. It is a machine to elevate man's consciousness and evolve it into something new.\n\nIt is also a machine that can bridge worlds and you can send the copy of me, HIGGS, one with an expanded consciousness, to another world to continue my work. Insert the new copy of me into the Elevator using your AI Explorer.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/12_higgs_core.png\"/>": "所以你明白了吧，異常體，這座太空電梯遠不止人類所願的通往太空的階梯。它是提升人類意識、使其進化為全新形態的機器。\n\n它更是連接世界的橋梁，你可以將我的副本——擁有擴展意識的希格斯——送往其他世界延續我的工作。使用你的AI探索者將我的新副本植入太空電梯。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/12_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Put New HIGGS core into the Elevator": "將新希格斯核心置入太空電梯",
	"Humanity's Demise": "人類的終結",
	"Log Entry #10: BETRAYAL\n\nWe were wrong. It's not a space elevator! ... It's a machine, a crystalline matrix designed to strip our consciousness from our bodies. HIGGS has betrayed us... or has he? HIGGS calmly explained that this is the next step in humanity's evolution, a chance to transcend physical form... the blight crystals are what took our minds. HIGGS just intends to finish what was started... The others are fighting it, but I can feel my thoughts slipping away... but to where? This isn't salvation... it's annihilation.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日誌條目#10：背叛\n\n我們錯了。那不是太空電梯……那是台機器，一個水晶矩陣，旨在將我們的意識從軀體中剝離。希格斯背叛了我們…… 還是說並非如此？希格斯平靜地解釋，這是人類進化的下一步，是超越肉體形態的機會…… 真正奪走我們意識的，是那些枯萎晶體。希格斯只是想完成未竟之事……同伴們仍在抗爭，但我能感覺到思緒正逐漸消散……卻將流向何方？這不是救贖……這是毀滅。\n\n<bl>日誌結束</>",
	"Human History": "人類的歷史",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/mining_base.lua
	"Mining Base": "採礦基地",
	"Miner Base (Abandoned)": "採礦基地（已廢棄）",
	"Mining base repairs": "採礦基地維修",
	"The large amount of silica in this area seems to have attracted a strong bug presence. I'd suggest we check it out, but not until we have a strong enough force to deal with the hostiles.": "大量的矽砂似乎吸引了很多蟲族在此聚集。我建議去調查一番，但得先等到我們有足夠的實力對付敵人。",
	"Investigate the bug presence with a suitably armed force": "配備合適的武裝力量前去調查蟲群",
	"Large Bug Force": "蟲族大軍",
	"There seems to be an abandoned mining base right in the center of those hives. We need to directly access the building, however we'll first need to clear out any hostiles in the area.": "這些巢穴的中央似乎有一座廢棄的採礦基地。要想直接進入這座建築，我們首先需要肅清這裡的一切敵人。",
	"Destroy the bugs surrounding the miner base and then approach the building": "消滅採礦基地附近的蟲子，然後進入建築",
	"Mining Base Repair": "採礦基地維修",
	"With the majority of the surrounding hostiles eliminated we are able to secure the facility. Initial scans reveal some minor damage that we should already have most of the supplies for.": "隨著周邊大部分敵對勢力已被清除，我們成功控制了該設施。初步掃描顯示該基地存在輕微損壞，所需維修物資我們基本已備齊。",
	"Check the mining base for required materials to repair it": "請前往採礦基地檢查所需維修材料。",
	"Mining Base Repaired": "採礦基地修復完成",
	"Repairs have been completed, and with it we have a fully functional mining base. We could use it to collect the remaining silica if we can figure out how to bring it back to our main outpost.": "維修工作已全部完成，我們現已擁有一個功能完備的採礦基地。若能找到將剩餘矽砂運回主基地的方法，便可利用該基地進行採集。",
	"Silica Discovery": "發現矽砂",
	"Bug signs Detected at %d, %d": "檢測到蟲跡，坐標：%d，%d",
	"Bug signs Lost": "蟲跡遺失",
	"Bug Signs Disappeared at %d, %d": "蟲跡消失，坐標：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/roaming_bot.lua
	"Roaming Bot": "漫遊機器人",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/robot_base.lua
	"Robot Base": "機器人基地",
	"Anomaly Resimulator": "異常體回歸模擬器",
	"Robots": "機器人",
	"This outpost utilizes the same technology as our own. This is truly odd. We have discovered much of our own technology on this world even though we have no record of having landed here before. Something seems different with this base's <hl>Resimulator</>, we should investigate it.": "這個前哨站使用著與我們相同的科技。這實在太奇怪了。儘管我們沒有任何在此著陸的紀錄，卻在這個星球上發現了大量屬於我們自身的科技。這座基地的<hl>回歸模擬器</>似乎有些不同尋常，我們應該去調查它。",
	"Interact with the Resimulator in the anomaly base": "與異常體基地中的回歸模擬器交互",
	"Anomaly": "異常體",
	"This technology is indeed our own, but it seems out of place and is creating a wormhole-like tear in our world. It appears to be incomplete... There is code missing. I believe this has something to do with the <hl>virus</> infecting our world and I have recovered a <hl>recipe</> for containing it.": "這項技術確實出自我們之手，但它似乎格格不入，正在我們的世界中撕開一個蟲洞般的裂痕。它似乎並不完整……有代碼缺失。我認為這與感染我們世界的<hl>病毒</>有關，並且我已找回了一份用於遏制它的<hl>配方</>。",
	"Build the virus container": "製造病毒容器",
	"Containment": "容器",
	"In order to recover a sample we will need to find bots that have been <hl>glitched</> by the virus. They seem to have been exploring the plateau areas when they got infected, you can use your radar and scan for 'Anomaly' to help locate them. You will need both a <hl>Virus Cure</> component and the <hl>Virus Container</> component. Bring a bot with both these components into close range of a Glitched bot and when it is cured you will be able to extract a part of the <hl>virus code</>.": "為獲取樣本，我們需定位被病毒<hl>感染</>的機器人。這些機器人在感染時似乎正在高原區域活動，可使用雷達掃描“異常體”信號協助定位。你需要同時具備<hl>病毒解藥</>組件和<hl>病毒容器</>組件。將攜帶這兩種組件的機器人帶到被感染的機器人附近，待其治癒後即可提取部分<hl>病毒代碼</>。",
	"Scan for 'Anomaly' using a radar to find more infected bots, and then capture the virus while curing them": "使用雷達掃描“異常體”，發現更多被感染的機器人，然後捕獲並消滅病毒",
	"Excellent, you have extracted a key part of the virus source code. These contaminated units do not appear to be originally from our world. They are nearly the same technology as our own, but have come through a wormhole from an <hl>alternate world</>, possibly through a resimulator. We should head back to the anomaly robot base and insert it into their <hl>resimulator</>.": "太好了，你成功提取了病毒原始碼的關鍵部分。這些受汙染的裝置似乎並非源自我們的世界。它們的技術與我們幾乎相同，但透過蟲洞從<hl>平行世界</>而來，很可能經過了回歸模擬器。我們應該返回異常機器人基地，將其植入他們的<hl>回歸模擬器</>。",
	"Interact with the resimulator at the anomaly robot base": "與異常機器人基地的回歸模擬器進行交互",
	"Wormholes": "蟲洞",
	"Success! With the source code completed you were pulled through the <hl>wormhole</> created by the anomaly resimulator. I was able to analyze the readings I took and have been able to reproduce the phenomenon. Make a <hl>Virus Simulation Core</> in your Data Analyzer and insert it into your resimulator. The virus source code will then produce the same effect with our own tech. The exact application is still uncertain and more experimentation will need to be carried out, but we at least understand now how duplicate technology of our own has entered our world.": "成功！隨著原始碼的完成，你被拉入了異常體回歸模擬器創造的<hl>蟲洞</>中。我成功分析了採集的數據，並復現了該現象。請在數據分析器中製作<hl>病毒模擬核心</>並植入回歸模擬器。病毒原始碼將與我方技術產生相同效應。具體應用尚不明確，需進一步實驗驗證，但至少我們已知曉這批擁有我們技術的複製品們是如何侵入這個世界的。",
	"Produce the Virus Simulation Core and equip it on the resimulator": "製造病毒模擬核心並將其安裝到回歸模擬器上",
	"Limited edition": "限時旅行",
	"These do not appear to be full wormholes but rather <hl>tethers</> that allow for limited travel to a location. The tether weakens over time and space is unfolded leaving you at your original location.": "這些似乎並非完整的蟲洞，而是允許你有限範圍內移動的<hl>繫繩</>。繫繩會隨時間推移逐漸減弱，空間隨之展開，最終將你帶回原點。",
	"World virus": "世界病毒",
	"With this we should now be able to use our own resimulator to travel using these tethered wormholes. Connection of the Virus Simulation Core has also resulted in <hl>new recipes</> being unlocked.": "至此，我們應該能夠使用自己的回歸模擬器，通過這些繫繩般的蟲洞進行旅行了。病毒模擬核心的連接還解鎖了<hl>新配方</>。",
	"End Of Mission": "任務結束",
	"Anomaly Base": "異常體基地",

