	"Big Daikon": "巨型蘿蔔",
	"Super Silica Tree": "超級矽砂樹",
	"So tall": "真高",
	"We are detecting some kind of anomaly in the world.\n\nOne the natural flora of the world is giving unusual readings. It appears mineable except scans indicate it has an extremely hard outer shell.\n\nIt's too strong to mine but perhaps there is some other way to acquire its resources.": "我們檢測到這世界出現了某種異常現象。\n\n這個世界上的某種天然植物出現了不同尋常的讀數。它似乎可以進行開採，但掃描結果顯示，它的外殼異常堅硬。\n\n過於堅硬的特性導致它無法被正常開採，但或許有其他方法可以讓我們獲得其中的資源。",
	"Destroy Giant Tree": "摧毀巨樹",
	"Disturbed the Hive!": "驚擾了蟲巢！",
	"The tree acted as a giant hive. You'll need to eliminate all hostiles in the area before destroying it.": "這棵樹就像一個巨型的蟲巢。你必須先清除該區域所有敵對目標，才能將其摧毀。",
	"Clear the area of enemies and destroy the giant tree hive": "清除區域內的敵人並摧毀巨樹巢穴",
	"Composition": "組成結構",
	"The trunk of the tree was made entirely of silica.\n\nWhile this one had matured and hardened too much to be mined there appears to be smaller ones that we should be able to extract small amounts of silica.\n\nThis should help us set up our initial silicon production.": "樹幹全部由矽砂構成。\n\n雖然這棵巨樹已經成熟，並且異常堅硬，無法開採，但似乎還有一些個頭較小的樹，我們可以從中開採出少量矽砂。\n\n這樣，我們就可以啟動第一次矽砂生產了。",
	"End of Mission - Silica Resources Acquired": "任務結束 - 已獲取矽砂資源",
	"That's a big tree!": "好大一棵樹！",
	"Big tree detected at %d, %d": "檢測到巨樹，坐標：%d，%d",
	"Tree was Destroyed": "巨樹已被摧毀",
