	"By default, behavior controllers run one instruction per tick. Unlock allows multiple instructions to execute within one tick until it hits a <hl>Wait Ticks</> instruction, the end of the behavior, or an instruction that takes time to execute such as a synchronous <hl>Move Unit</> instruction.\n\nIf more than the set number (default 1000) of instructions are executed in one tick then the behavior will abort or continue the next tick.\n\nNote: Running too many instructions in one tick can cause the game to slow down.": "預設情況下，行為控制器每個遊戲刻運行一條指令。 「解鎖」功能允許在一個遊戲刻內執行多個指令，直到遇到<hl>等待遊戲刻</>指令、行為結束或需要時間執行的指令（例如同步的<hl>移動單位</>指令）為止。\n\n如果在一個遊戲刻內執行的指令數量超過設定值（預設值為 1000），則行為將中止或在下一個遊戲刻繼續執行。\n\n注意：在一個遊戲刻機內運行過多指令可能會導致遊戲運行速度變慢。", // <temporary automatic translation>
