	"Failed to set register": "設置暫存器失敗",
	"Set to Component Remotely": "遠程設置組件",
	"Writes a value into a component register on an external unit": "向外部裝置的組件暫存器寫入數值",
	"Remotely set an external unit's component register to a value. Diverts logic if instruction fails.\n\nThe source and target units <bl>must be adjacent</> unless running on an <img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "遠程將外部裝置的組件暫存器設置為指定值。指令失敗時進行邏輯分流。\n\n源裝置與目標裝置<bl>必須相鄰</>，除非運行於<img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"The unit to get component register from (if not self)": "獲取組件暫存器的裝置（若非自身）",
	"Component and register number to get remotely": "需遠程獲取的組件及暫存器編號",
	"Failed to get register": "獲取暫存器失敗",
	"Get from Component Remotely": "遠程獲取組件值",
	"Reads a value from a component register on an external unit": "從外部裝置讀取組件暫存器數值",
	"Remotely read an external unit's component register value. Diverts logic if instruction fails.\n\nThe source and target units <bl>must be adjacent</> unless running on an <img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "遠程讀取外部裝置的組件暫存器值。指令失敗時進行邏輯分流。\n\n源裝置與目標裝置<bl>必須相鄰</>，除非運行於<img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"The unit to load the behavior on (if not self)": "載入行為的目標裝置（若非自身）",
	"Load Behavior": "載入行為",
	"Load and run a behavior on an external unit": "在外部裝置載入並運行行為",
	"Remotely run a behavior on another unit. Will automatically install an <img id=\"c_integrated_behavior\" style=\"hl\"/> if needed.\n\nThe source and target units <bl>must be adjacent</> unless running on an <img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "遠程在另一裝置運行行為。必要時將自動安裝<img id=\"c_integrated_behavior\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n\n源裝置與目標裝置<bl>必須相鄰</>，或者在<img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>上運行。",
	"Id to register with": "寄存的ID",
	"Build Registered": "建造寄存建築",
	"Places a building to be registered": "放置待寄存的建造",
	"Constructs a structure or unit defined in a register at a given location or the current location if not specified.": "在指定位置（或默認當前位置）建造暫存器中定義的結構或裝置。",
	"Produce Registered Unit": "生產寄存裝置",
	"AutoBase-only instruction that starts production of a unit blueprint and registers it under the requested id.\n\nIf the AutoBase already has enough registered units for the requested id and amount, it does nothing. If an idle matching production component is available, it assigns the blueprint and continues through <hl>If Working</> while waiting for production to progress.\n\n<hl>Node Settings</>\nThe production selector controls which unit blueprint is produced and adds any ingredient/blueprint pins needed by that selection.": "此指令僅供 AutoBase 使用，用於啟動單位藍圖的生產並將其註冊到請求的 ID 下。\n\n如果 AutoBase 已註冊了足夠數量的單位，且 ID 和數量與要求的 ID 相符，則此指令不執行任何操作。如果存在空閒的匹配生產元件，則此指令會指派藍圖，並在等待生產完成期間繼續執行 <hl>如果有效</> 操作。\n\n<hl>節點設定</>\n生產選擇器控制生產哪個單位藍圖，並添加該選擇所需的任何原料/藍圖引腳。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Signal value": "信號值",
	"Radio Event": "無線電事件",
	"Run event when the signal of the specified radio band changes its value": "當指定無線電頻段的信號值發生變化時觸發事件",
	"Starts this branch when the selected radio band receives a new value.\n\nThe band is selected in the node body, not through an input pin. When the event fires, <hl>Signal</> receives the new radio value.\n\nUse this for event-driven behaviors that should sleep until a radio signal changes instead of polling with <hl>Read Radio</>.\n\n<hl>Node Settings</>\nThe band chooses the radio channel to watch. If no band is selected, no event watcher is installed.": "當選定的無線電頻段接收到新值時，此分支會啟動。\n\n頻段的選擇在節點主體中進行，而非透過輸入引腳。事件觸發時，<hl>訊號</> 會接收新的無線電值。\n\n對於需要等待無線電訊號變化的事件驅動行為，請使用此分支，而不是使用 <hl>讀取無線電</> 進行輪詢。\n\n<hl>節點設定</>\n頻段用於選擇要監視的無線電頻道。如果未選擇頻段，則不會安裝事件監視器。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Parameter Event": "參數事件",
	"Run event when the value of the specified parameter changes": "當指定參數的值發生變化時觸發事件",
	"Starts this branch when the selected behavior parameter changes value.\n\nThe watched parameter is selected in the node body. This is useful for behaviors that should react immediately when a controller register is edited or linked from another register.\n\n<hl>Node Settings</>\nParameter chooses which behavior parameter to watch. If no parameter is selected, no event watcher is installed.": "當選定的行為參數值變更時，啟動此分支。\n\n被監視的參數在節點主體中選擇。這對於在控制器暫存器被編輯或從另一個暫存器連結時應立即做出反應的行為非常有用。\n\n<hl>節點設定</>\n參數用於選擇要監視的行為參數。如果未選擇任何參數，則不會安裝事件監視器。", // <temporary automatic translation>
