	"Set memory array value at a given index": "在指定索引處設置記憶體數組值",
	"Set memory array value at a given index. No index will add a new element to the end of the array (push).": "在指定索引處設置記憶體數組值。未指定索引時將在數組末尾添加新元素（入棧）。",
	"Array identifier or empty to process known identifiers": "數組標識符或空數組用於處理已知標識符", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Length": "長度", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Memory Length": "記憶體長度",
	"Get length of memory array": "獲取記憶體數組長度",
	"Retrieves the length of a memory array.\n\nWill return the length of the memory array specified by the array identifier <hl>Id</> or the total number of arrays in memory if no <hl>Id</> is specified.": "取得記憶體數組的長度。\n\n將傳回由陣列標識符 <hl>Id</> 指定的記憶體數組的長度；如果未指定 <hl>Id</>，則傳回記憶體中數組的總數。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Memory Insert": "記憶體插入",
