	"Insert value into memory array, shifting elements above upwards. No index will add a new element to the end of the array (push).": "向記憶體數組插入值，上方元素向上位移。未指定索引時在數組末尾添加新元素（入棧）。",
	"Old Value": "舊值",
	"Removed value": "已移除值",
	"Memory Remove": "記憶體移除",
	"Remove value from memory array": "從記憶體數組移除值",
	"Remove value from a memory array, shifting elements above downwards.\nNo index will remove from the end of the array (pop).\nSpecifying ∞ will clear the array.": "從記憶體數組移除指定值，上方元素向下移動。\n未指定索引時將從數組末尾移除（彈出）。\n指定∞將清空數組。",
	"Filter value": "篩選值", // <temporary automatic translation>
