	"Remove multiple items of a memory array with a filter": "使用過濾器從記憶體數組中移除多個元素。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Remove multiple items of a memory array depending on the filter comparison mode and value.\n\nIf an identifier <hl>Id</> is specified, values of the array with that identifier will be filtered.\nOtherwise the instruction will remove full arrays depending on their identifier keys.": "根據篩選比較模式和值，從記憶體數組中移除多個元素。\n\n如果指定了識別碼 `<hl>Id</>`，則會篩選出陣列中具有該識別符的值。\n否則，該指令將根據標識符鍵移除整個數組。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Loop Memory": "遍歷記憶體",
	"Loops through memory array or known array identifiers": "遍歷記憶體數組或已知數組標識符",
	"Loops through all entries stored in a memory list.\n\nIf an identifier <hl>Id</> is specified, all sequential values of the array with that identifier will be evaluated, starting from 1.\nOtherwise the instruction will enumerate over all identifier keys in the memory.": "遍歷記憶體清單中儲存的所有條目。\n\n如果指定了識別碼 `<hl>Id</>`，則會從 1 開始計算數組中所有具有該識別碼的連續值。\n否則，該指令將枚舉記憶體中的所有標識符鍵。", // <temporary automatic translation>

