	// FILE: Main/data/puzzles.lua
	"Nine Clicks Minigame": "小遊戲：九步解謎",
	"To complete the circuit, all lines need to be switched to the active state. Click a node to toggle the state of it and its neighbors.\n\nTry selecting all corner pieces first, then center pieces, even if more corner pieces appear while doing so. Do this a couple times and the puzzle should be solved.": "要完成電路，就需要將所有節點切換至啟用狀態。點擊一個節點可切換該節點及其相鄰節點的狀態。\n\n先選擇所有角落的節點，再選擇中間節點，即使在此過程中會出現更多角落節點，也應按此順序操作。重複該操作數次，就能解開謎題。",
	"Netwalk Minigame": "小遊戲：網路漫步",
	"To complete the circuit, all lines need to be connected to the source node. Rotate any of the squares by clicking them to highlight all the nodes.": "要完成電路，就需要將所有節點連接到源節點上。點擊任意正方形進行旋轉，以點亮所有節點。",
	"Slide Minigame": "小遊戲：數字滑動",
	"slide numbers into numerical order": "按數字順序滑動數字",
	"Balance Minigame": "小遊戲：完美平衡",
	"Pick the right combination of symbols by dragging them to the right column to complete the circuit. The bar underneath must be filled precisely in half.": "選擇正確的符號組合，將其拖動到正確的列中，以完成電路。下方進度條必須精準地分為兩半。",

