	"Conditional node which diverts program logic depending on whether the unit or a specific location is inside the <hl>blight</>.\n\nThis instruction will only return true for locations <bl>inside</> and not <bl>near</> the blight.\nNote: <img id=\"c_blight_extractor\" style=\"hl\"/> work near the blight.\n\n<hl>Target</>\nExternal target to check. Target will default to the unit running the Behavior if no value has been set.": "條件節點，根據裝置或特定位置是否位於<hl>枯萎區</>內部來分流程序邏輯。\n\n該指令僅對位於枯萎區域<bl>內部</>的位置返回真值，而非<bl>鄰近</>區域的位置。\n註：<img id=\"c_blight_extractor\" style=\"hl\"/>在枯萎區域附近生效。\n\n<hl>目標</>\n需檢測的外部目標。若未設置值，目標默認指向執行該行為的裝置。", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
