	"Continues execution of the behavior depending on the type of <hl>Unit</> passed.\n\n<hl>Dropped items</> will be executed as <hl>No Unit</>": "根據傳遞的<hl>裝置</>類型繼續執行相應行為。\n\n<hl>掉落物品</>將按<hl>無裝置</>類型執行。", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
