	"Copy a value to a frame register, parameter or variable": "將值複製到框架暫存器、參數或變數", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
	"Creates a coordinate value from two numbers representing x and y.": "根據兩個分別代表x和y的數字創建坐標值。", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
	"Creates a link between two registers.\n\n<hl>From</> specifies the component and register number on that register to start the link\n<hl>To</> specifies the component and register number of the register to end the link\n\n- If no number is specified it will get the first register.\n- Extra variables for <hl>Component Index</> allow specifying registers if multiple of the same component are equipped.\n- If no component is specified then it will use the frame registers for the unit.\n\nExample:\n- Link the result register of the Scout Radar to the frames <bl>Visual</> Register\n- Link the Missing Ingredient register of the second equipped fabricator to the units <bl>Signal</> Register.": "創建兩個暫存器之間的連結。\n\n<hl>From</> 指定該暫存器上用於連結開始的組件和暫存器編號\n<hl>To</> 指定該暫存器上用於連結結束的組件和暫存器編號\n\n- 若未指定編號，則獲取第一個暫存器。\n- <hl>組件索引</>的附加變數可在同一組件存在多個實例時指定暫存器。\n- 若未指定組件，則使用該裝置的框架暫存器。\n\n範例：\n- 將偵察雷達的結果暫存器連結至框架的<bl>視覺</>暫存器\n- 將第二個裝備製造機的缺失原料暫存器連結至裝置<bl>信號</>暫存器。", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
	"Creates a register from individual components like number, entity, ID, and coordinates.\n\nNote: A Register can hold a number, and then one of the following: ID, entity, coordinate.": "創建一個由數字、實體、ID和坐標等獨立組件構成的暫存器。\n\n注意：暫存器可儲存數字，以及以下任一類型數據：ID、實體、坐標。", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
